('0031','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-curl.jpg',array['Stand tall with your feet hip-width apart and hold the barbell at your thighs with an underhand grip.','Set your shoulders back, brace your torso, and keep your elbows pinned by your sides.','Curl the bar upward by bending your elbows until the bar reaches about shoulder height.','Pause briefly at the top and squeeze your biceps without letting your elbows drift forward.','Lower the bar slowly back to your thighs until your arms are straight.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['barbell curl','barbell biceps curl','standing barbell curl','BB curl','straight bar curl','barbell arm curl']::text[],'A standing biceps exercise where you curl a barbell from your thighs to shoulder height with an underhand grip.',array['Swinging the torso to start the bar moving','Letting the elbows drift forward as the bar rises','Bending the wrists back instead of keeping them neutral','Dropping the bar quickly on the way down']::text[],array['Elbows stay by your sides','Lift with the biceps','Keep wrists straight','Control the lowering']::text[],'Exhale as you curl the bar up, and inhale as you lower it back down under control.',4.5),
('0033','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Decline Bench Press',array['pectorals','triceps']::text[],array['triceps','shoulders']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-decline-bench-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-decline-bench-press.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-decline-bench-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-decline-bench-press.jpg',array['Lie on the decline bench and secure your legs under the pads with your eyes under the bar.','Grip the bar slightly wider than shoulder width and pull your shoulder blades back into the bench.','Unrack the bar and hold it above your lower chest with straight wrists and locked elbows.','Lower the bar under control to your lower chest or upper sternum while keeping your elbows at about a 45-degree angle.','Press the bar straight up until your elbows are extended and the bar returns over your lower chest.','Repeat each rep with the same bar path and controlled tempo.']::text[],'chest','intermediate',true,false,array['decline barbell bench press','decline bench press','barbell decline press','decline chest press','decline barbell press','barbell decline bench press']::text[],'A decline barbell press done on a downward-angled bench to train the chest, triceps, and shoulders through a pressing pattern.',array['Bouncing the bar off the chest','Flaring the elbows straight out to the sides','Letting the wrists bend back under the bar','Pressing the bar toward the face instead of over the chest']::text[],array['Drive shoulders into bench','Wrists stacked over forearms','Lower to lower chest','Press straight up']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the bar to your chest, and exhale as you press it back up.',6.0),
('0038','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Drag Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-drag-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-drag-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-drag-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-drag-curl.jpg',array['Stand tall with feet about hip-width apart and hold the barbell with an underhand grip at your thighs.','Pull your shoulders slightly back and keep your elbows behind your torso.','Curl the bar upward by sliding it close along the front of your body as your elbows travel back.','Lift until the bar reaches your upper stomach or lower chest without letting it drift away from you.','Lower the barbell slowly along the same path until your arms are straight again.']::text[],'upper arms','intermediate',false,false,array['drag curl','barbell biceps drag curl','bar drag curl','drag bicep curl','close-body barbell curl','barbell drag curl']::text[],'A barbell biceps curl variation where the bar stays close to the torso and the elbows move back as you lift.',array['Letting the bar swing forward away from the body','Bending the wrists back as the bar rises','Rocking the torso to start the curl','Flaring the elbows out to the sides']::text[],array['Keep the bar close','Drive elbows back','Chest tall','Control the lowering']::text[],'Inhale at the bottom, exhale as you drag-curl the bar up, and inhale as you lower it back down.',4.5),
('0041','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Front Raise',array['delts','biceps']::text[],array['biceps','triceps']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-front-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-front-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-front-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-front-raise.jpg',array['Stand tall with your feet hip-width apart and hold the barbell against your thighs with an overhand grip.','Brace your core and keep a soft bend in your elbows.','Raise the barbell straight forward in front of you until it reaches shoulder height.','Pause briefly without shrugging your shoulders.','Lower the barbell back to your thighs with control.','Reset your posture and repeat the movement.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',false,false,array['front raise','barbell front raise','barbell shoulder raise','straight-arm front raise','front delt raise']::text[],'A shoulder isolation exercise where you lift a barbell straight in front of your body to train the front delts.',array['Leaning back to start the lift.','Swinging the barbell with the hips.','Raising the barbell above shoulder height.','Shrugging the shoulders toward the ears.']::text[],array['Lift to shoulder height','Keep ribs down','Lead with your hands','Avoid swinging']::text[],'Exhale as you raise the barbell, and inhale as you lower it back down.',4.5),
('0042','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Front Squat',array['quads','quadriceps femoris']::text[],array['glutes','hamstrings','erector spinae','core']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-front-chest-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-front-chest-squat.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-front-chest-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-front-chest-squat.jpg',array['Rack barbell at collarbone level, elbows up.','Stand with feet shoulder-width apart.','Descend into squat keeping torso upright.','Lower until thighs are parallel to floor.','Drive up through heels to stand.']::text[],'upper legs','intermediate',true,false,array['front squat','barbell front squat','front chest squat','Barbell Front Chest Squat']::text[],'Squat variation with barbell held at the front rack position, targeting the quadriceps.',array['Letting elbows drop','Rounding back','Heels lifting off floor']::text[],array['Elbows high','Torso upright','Heels down','Keep knees tracking over toes']::text[],'Inhale when lowering, exhale standing up.',6.0),
('0047','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Incline Bench Press',array['pectorals','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders','triceps']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-incline-bench-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-incline-bench-press.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-incline-bench-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-incline-bench-press.jpg',array['Set an incline bench and lie back with your eyes under the bar and your feet flat on the floor.','Grip the bar slightly wider than shoulder width with straight wrists and pull your shoulder blades down and back.','Unrack the bar and hold it above your upper chest with your arms straight.','Lower the bar under control to your upper chest, keeping your elbows slightly tucked from straight out.','Press the bar upward until your arms are straight again, keeping the bar path over your shoulders.','Rack the bar back onto the supports with control after your final rep.']::text[],'chest','intermediate',true,false,array['incline barbell bench press','incline bench press','barbell incline press','incline chest press','upper chest barbell press','barbell incline bench press']::text[],'A pressing exercise on an incline bench using a barbell to train the upper chest, shoulders, and triceps.',array['Flaring the elbows straight out to the sides','Bouncing the bar off the chest','Lifting the feet or shifting on the bench','Lowering the bar to the neck or stomach']::text[],array['Drive feet into floor','Keep chest up','Wrists stacked over elbows','Press straight up']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the bar to your chest, and exhale as you press it back up.',6.0),
('0054','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Lunge',array['glutes','quadriceps']::text[],array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-lunge.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-lunge.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-lunge.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-lunge.jpg',array['Set the barbell across your upper back and stand tall with feet hip-width apart.','Brace your core and take a controlled step forward with one foot.','Lower your body until both knees bend and your back knee moves toward the floor.','Keep your front foot flat and your torso upright at the bottom position.','Push through the front foot to stand back up and bring your feet together.','Repeat on the other side, alternating legs each rep.']::text[],'upper legs','intermediate',true,true,array['barbell lunge','barbell forward lunge','barbell walking lunge in place','barbell alternating lunge','barbell split step lunge','lunges with barbell on back']::text[],'A lower-body lunge with a barbell on your upper back that trains the glutes, quads, and hamstrings one leg at a time.',array['Taking such a short step that the front knee shoots far past the toes.','Leaning the torso forward as you lower.','Letting the front knee cave inward.','Pushing off the back foot instead of driving through the front foot.']::text[],array['Stay tall','Front heel stays down','Track knees over toes','Control the descent']::text[],'Inhale as you step forward and lower down, then exhale as you push back to standing.',6.0),
('0072','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Prone Incline Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-prone-incline-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-prone-incline-curl.jpg',null,null,array['Set an incline bench and lie face down with your chest supported and your feet planted on the floor.','Hold the barbell with an underhand grip about shoulder-width apart and let your arms hang straight down.','Brace your torso against the bench and keep your upper arms still.','Curl the barbell upward by bending your elbows until the bar reaches near the front of your shoulders.','Squeeze your biceps briefly at the top without lifting your chest off the bench.','Lower the barbell under control until your elbows are fully extended again.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['prone incline barbell curl','incline chest-supported barbell curl','face-down incline barbell curl','barbell spider curl','incline biceps curl with barbell','barbell prone incline curl']::text[],'A chest-supported biceps curl on an incline bench using a barbell to isolate elbow flexion with minimal body swing.',array['Lifting the chest off the bench to help the bar up','Letting the elbows drift forward during the curl','Using body swing or kicking the legs to create momentum','Dropping the bar quickly instead of lowering it under control']::text[],array['Keep elbows pinned','Curl, don''t swing','Chest stays on bench','Control the lowering']::text[],'Inhale at the bottom, exhale as you curl the bar up, and inhale again as you lower it back down.',4.5),
('0075','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Rear Delt Raise',array['delts','traps']::text[],array['traps','rhomboids']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-rear-delt-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-rear-delt-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-rear-delt-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-rear-delt-raise.jpg',array['Stand tall holding the barbell with a shoulder-width overhand grip.','Soften your knees and hinge at your hips until your torso is nearly parallel to the floor.','Let the bar hang below your chest with your arms straight and your neck neutral.','Raise the bar out and up by moving your upper arms to the sides until they reach shoulder height.','Pause briefly at the top while keeping your torso still.','Lower the bar under control to the starting position.']::text[],'shoulders','intermediate',true,false,array['rear delt raise','barbell rear delt raise','barbell bent-over reverse raise','bent-over barbell rear fly','bent-over shoulder raise']::text[],'A bent-over barbell raise that targets the rear delts by lifting the arms out to the sides while holding a barbell.',array['Rounding the lower back as you hinge forward','Swinging the torso to heave the bar upward','Shrugging the shoulders toward the ears','Turning it into a row by bending the elbows too much']::text[],array['Hinge, don''t round','Lead with your elbows','Keep neck neutral','Control the lowering']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the bar and set your hinge, then exhale as you raise the bar out to the sides.',6.0),
('0082','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Reverse Wrist Curl',array['forearm extensors']::text[],array['brachioradialis']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-reverse-wrist-curl-over-grip.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-reverse-wrist-curl-over-grip.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-reverse-wrist-curl-over-grip.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-reverse-wrist-curl-over-grip.jpg',array['Sit on a bench and grasp a barbell with an overhand (pronated) grip.','Rest your forearms on your thighs with wrists hanging just beyond your knees.','Begin with your wrists flexed downward.','Slowly curl your wrists upward, lifting the barbell.','Lower under control to the starting position.']::text[],'lower arms','beginner',false,false,array['over-grip wrist curl','reverse wrist curl','barbell pronated wrist curl','Barbell Reverse Wrist Curl (over-grip)','barbell reverse wrist curl']::text[],'A wrist flexion exercise performed with a pronated grip to target the forearm extensors.',array['Using too much weight','Lifting with elbows or shoulders','Letting the barbell roll in hands']::text[],array['Keep forearms stationary','Use slow, controlled motion','Only wrists should move','Avoid swinging']::text[],'Exhale as you curl the bar up, inhale as you lower.',4.5),
('drv-barbell-seated-behind-head-military-press','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Seated Behind-The-Neck Press',array['deltoids','deltoid']::text[],array['triceps','upper trapezius']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-seated-behind-head-military-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-seated-behind-head-military-press.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-seated-behind-head-military-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-seated-behind-head-military-press.jpg',array['Sit on a bench with back support; grip barbell wider than shoulders.','Unrack barbell and hold above your head.','Lower barbell behind your head to just below ear level.','Press barbell back up to the starting position.','Repeat for desired reps, keeping core engaged.']::text[],'shoulders','advanced',true,false,array['behind head military press','barbell behind neck press','seated behind neck shoulder press']::text[],'A shoulder press variation performed seated with a barbell lowered behind the neck to target the deltoids.',array['Flaring elbows excessively','Arching lower back','Lowering bar too far']::text[],array['Keep back upright','Don''t arch lower back','Lower bar with control','Use full range']::text[],'Exhale when pressing up, inhale when lowering the bar.',6.0),
('0095','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Shrug',array['traps','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-shrug.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-shrug.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-shrug.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-shrug.jpg',array['Stand tall with your feet hip- to shoulder-width apart and hold the barbell in front of your thighs with an overhand grip.','Let your arms hang straight, brace your torso, and keep your chest up.','Lift your shoulders straight up toward your ears without bending your elbows or leaning back.','Pause briefly at the top and squeeze your upper traps.','Lower your shoulders under control until they return to the starting position.']::text[],'back','beginner',false,false,array['barbell shrug','BB shrug','barbell shoulder shrug','standing barbell shrug','barbell trap shrug','shoulder raise with barbell']::text[],'A standing trap exercise where you hold a barbell at your thighs and lift your shoulders straight up and down.',array['Bending the elbows to curl the bar upward.','Rolling the shoulders forward or backward at the top.','Leaning back and swinging the torso to move the bar.','Letting the head jut forward as the shoulders rise.']::text[],array['Shoulders straight up','Arms stay long','Chest tall','No rolling']::text[],'Inhale before each rep, exhale as you shrug your shoulders up, and inhale as you lower back down.',4.5),
('0104','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Standing Back Wrist Curl',array['forearms','biceps']::text[],array['biceps','shoulders']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-standing-back-wrist-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-standing-back-wrist-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-standing-back-wrist-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-standing-back-wrist-curl.jpg',array['Stand tall with your feet about hip-width apart and hold a barbell behind your hips with an overhand grip.','Let the bar rest across your fingers so your knuckles face the floor and your palms face behind you.','Keep your elbows close to your sides and straighten your wrists to lower the bar toward your fingertips.','Curl your wrists upward to roll the bar back into your hands and lift it as high as you can.','Pause briefly at the top, then lower the bar with control back to the starting position.']::text[],'lower arms','beginner',false,false,array['behind-the-back wrist curl','barbell behind-the-back wrist curl','reverse wrist curl behind back','standing back wrist curl','barbell wrist curl behind body','forearm wrist curl behind back','barbell standing back wrist curl']::text[],'A standing forearm exercise where you hold a barbell behind your body and lift it by curling only your wrists.',array['Swinging the bar with the shoulders or torso','Bending the elbows to lift the bar','Letting the bar slip too far out of the hands','Using short, jerky wrist motions']::text[],array['Move only your wrists','Keep elbows pinned back','Use full wrist range','Control the lowering']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the bar toward your fingertips, and exhale as you curl your wrists up.',4.5),
('0116','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Straight Leg Deadlift',array['hamstrings','glutes']::text[],array['glutes','lower back']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-straight-leg-deadlift.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-straight-leg-deadlift.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-straight-leg-deadlift.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-straight-leg-deadlift.jpg',array['Stand tall with your feet hip-width apart and hold the barbell in front of your thighs with straight arms.','Soften your knees slightly and brace your midsection.','Push your hips back and lower the bar down your legs while keeping your back flat and your legs nearly straight.','Lower until the bar reaches mid-shin or until you feel a strong hamstring stretch without losing your back position.','Drive your hips forward and stand tall, keeping the bar close to your legs the whole way up.','Finish with your hips locked out and shoulders stacked over your hips.']::text[],'upper legs','intermediate',true,false,array['straight leg deadlift','SLDL','barbell SLDL','stiff leg deadlift','stiff-legged barbell deadlift','barbell hamstring deadlift','barbell straight leg deadlift']::text[],'A barbell hip hinge that trains the hamstrings and glutes by lowering the bar down the legs with minimal knee bend.',array['Bending the knees into a squat as the bar lowers','Letting the bar drift forward away from the legs','Rounding the lower back near the bottom','Jerking the bar off the bottom instead of lifting smoothly']::text[],array['Hips back, not down','Keep the bar close','Soft knees, flat back','Stand tall and squeeze glutes']::text[],'Inhale and brace before hinging down, then exhale as you drive your hips forward to stand up.',6.0),
('0027','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Underhand Bent-Over Row',array['lats','latissimus dorsi']::text[],array['biceps','rhomboids','trapezius','rear deltoids']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-underhand-bent-over-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-underhand-bent-over-row.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-underhand-bent-over-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-underhand-bent-over-row.jpg',array['Stand with feet hip-width apart, barbell on floor.','Bend forward from hips, back straight, grasp bar underhand.','Let bar hang at arm’s length below shoulders.','Row barbell to torso, elbows close to sides.','Lower barbell under control to starting position.']::text[],'back','intermediate',true,false,array['reverse grip barbell row','underhand grip barbell row','supinated barbell row','Barbell Underhand Bent-over Row','barbell bent over row']::text[],'Row performed bent over with barbell and an underhand (supinated) grip, targeting lats and biceps.',array['Rounding lower back','Flaring elbows excessively','Using momentum']::text[],array['Keep back flat','Pull with elbows','Squeeze shoulder blades','Keep wrists neutral']::text[],'Exhale as you row up, inhale as you lower down.',6.0),
('0123','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Barbell Wide-Grip Upright Row',array['deltoids']::text[],array['trapezius','biceps']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/barbell-upright-row-wide-grip.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/barbell-upright-row-wide-grip.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/barbell-upright-row-wide-grip.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/barbell-upright-row-wide-grip.jpg',array['Stand upright with feet shoulder width apart.','Hold the barbell using a wide, overhand grip.','Let the bar rest in front of your thighs.','Lift the bar straight up toward your chest, elbows out to the sides.','Lower the bar slowly to the starting position.']::text[],'shoulders','intermediate',true,false,array['wide-grip upright row','wide grip barbell upright row','Barbell Upright Row (wide-grip)','barbell wide-grip upright row']::text[],'A compound barbell lift with a wide grip to target the shoulders and upper back.',array['Shrugging shoulders excessively','Using too much momentum','Hands too close']::text[],array['Lead with your elbows','Keep bar close to your body','Stop at upper chest','Maintain neutral spine']::text[],'Exhale as you lift, inhale as you lower.',6.0),
('0128','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Battling Ropes',array['delts','forearms']::text[],array['forearms','core']::text[],'rope','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/battling-ropes.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/battling-ropes.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/battling-ropes.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/battling-ropes.jpg',array['Anchor your stance with feet about shoulder-width apart and bend your knees slightly.','Hold one rope end in each hand with your palms facing each other and your arms in front of you.','Brace your core and lift one hand as you lower the other to start the waves.','Keep alternating your arms quickly to send continuous waves down the ropes.','Maintain the slight knee bend and steady torso as you keep the waves even.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',true,false,array['battle ropes','battling rope waves','alternating battle rope waves','rope waves','battle rope exercise','battling ropes']::text[],'A rope conditioning exercise using alternating arm waves to train the shoulders, forearms, and core.',array['Standing upright with locked knees','Swinging the whole torso instead of the arms','Letting the waves become uneven or stop','Lifting the shoulders up toward the ears']::text[],array['Move arms fast','Keep chest tall','Brace your core','Make even waves']::text[],'Breathe steadily throughout, exhaling with the arm drive and inhaling as the arms switch.',6.0),
('drv-crunch-on-bench','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Bench Crunch',array['rectus abdominis']::text[],array['obliques']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/crunch-on-bench.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/crunch-on-bench.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/crunch-on-bench.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/crunch-on-bench.jpg',array['Lie flat on a bench with knees bent and feet secured or flat.','Cross your arms over your chest or place hands behind your head.','Engage your core and lift your shoulders towards your knees.','Squeeze at the top and hold briefly.','Lower your upper body back to bench in a controlled manner.']::text[],'waist','beginner',false,false,array['crunch on bench','ab crunch on bench','bench ab crunch']::text[],'An abdominal crunch performed lying on a flat or decline bench to isolate the abs.',array['Pulling on neck','Rushing reps','Lifting too high']::text[],array['Lift with your abs','Keep chin tucked','Don''t arch back','Control the motion']::text[],'Exhale as you lift, inhale as you lower.',3.8),
('drv-bench-dips','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Bench Dips',array['triceps','triceps brachii']::text[],array['pectorals','anterior deltoids']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/bench-dips.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/bench-dips.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/bench-dips.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/bench-dips.jpg',array['Sit on a bench and place your hands beside your hips, gripping the edge.','Extend your legs out in front with heels on the floor.','Slide your hips off the bench, supporting your weight with your arms.','Lower your body by bending your elbows to about 90 degrees.','Push through your palms to extend your elbows and return to the start.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',true,false,array['triceps dips','bodyweight dips on bench','bench tricep dips']::text[],'Bench dips are a bodyweight exercise targeting the triceps by lowering and raising the body using a bench for support.',array['Allowing elbows to flare out','Shrugging shoulders upward','Dropping hips too low']::text[],array['Keep elbows close to body','Lower slowly and with control','Keep chest tall','Avoid shrugging shoulders']::text[],'Inhale as you lower down, exhale as you press upward.',5.0),
('0570','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Bench Pull-Up',array['lats','latissimus dorsi']::text[],array['biceps brachii','rhomboids','brachialis','trapezius']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/bench-pull-ups.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/bench-pull-ups.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/bench-pull-ups.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/bench-pull-ups.jpg',array['Place a bench under a pull-up bar.','Grip the bar with hands wider than shoulder-width.','Position feet on the bench for support.','Pull your chest towards the bar, using feet as needed.','Lower yourself slowly to starting position.']::text[],'back','beginner',true,false,array['assisted pull-up','feet-elevated pull-up','bench-supported pull-up','Bench Pull-ups','leg pull in flat bench']::text[],'A pull-up variation using a bench for foot support to reduce load and assist the movement.',array['Using too much leg drive','Swinging body or kicking feet','Chin barely reaching bar','Not controlling descent']::text[],array['Keep core engaged','Lead with chest','Pull elbows down and back','Don''t let legs push too much']::text[],'Exhale as you pull up, inhale as you lower down.',5.0),
('3639','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Bent Knee Lying Twist on Stability Ball',array['obliques']::text[],array['rectus abdominis','glutes']::text[],'stability ball',null,null,'https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/bent-knee-lying-twist-on-stability-ball.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/bent-knee-lying-twist-on-stability-ball.jpg',array['Lie on your back with calves on a stability ball.','Extend arms out at your sides for support.','Bend knees at 90 degrees over the ball.','Slowly drop knees to one side, keeping shoulders flat.','Return to center and repeat on the other side.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',false,false,array['lying knee twist','spinal twist ball','stability ball lying twist','Bent knee Lying  twist (On Stability Ball)','bent knee lying twist']::text[],'A rotational stretch on a stability ball that targets the obliques and hip flexors.',array['Letting shoulders lift off floor','Moving too quickly','Over-twisting hips']::text[],array['Keep shoulders grounded','Control the twist','Engage core','Move slowly']::text[],'Exhale as you twist, inhale returning to center.',4.5),
('drv-stretching-bridge-pose-setu-bandhasana','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Bridge Pose (Setu Bandhasana)',array['glutes','gluteus maximus']::text[],array['hamstrings','spinal erectors','hip flexors']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-bridge-pose-setu-bandhasana.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-bridge-pose-setu-bandhasana.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/stretching-bridge-pose-setu-bandhasana.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/stretching-bridge-pose-setu-bandhasana.jpg',array['Lie on your back with your knees bent and feet hip-width apart.','Place your arms at your sides, palms down.','Press through your heels and lift your hips upward.','Hold the pose, engaging your glutes and core.','Lower your hips back to the starting position.']::text[],'waist','beginner',false,false,array['bridge stretch','setu bandha','yoga bridge']::text[],'A yoga pose that stretches and activates the glutes, lower back, and hip flexors.',array['Arching the back excessively','Letting knees fall outward or inward','Not engaging the core']::text[],array['Squeeze glutes at the top','Keep knees aligned with hips','Do not overarch lower back','Press evenly through feet']::text[],'Exhale as you lift hips, inhale as you lower down.',3.8),
('drv-stretching-bridge-pose-setu-bandhasana-1','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Bridge Pose (Setu Bandhasana)',array['glutes','gluteus maximus']::text[],array['hamstrings','lower back','hip flexors']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-bridge-pose-setu-bandhasana-1.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-bridge-pose-setu-bandhasana-1.jpg',null,null,array['Lie flat on your back with knees bent and feet hip-width apart.','Place arms alongside your body, palms down.','Press into your heels to lift your hips off the floor, creating a straight line from knees to shoulders.','Engage your glutes and hold the top position for several seconds.','Lower your hips back down in a controlled motion.']::text[],'waist','beginner',true,false,array['yoga bridge','setu bandhasana','supine bridge stretch']::text[],'Bridge Pose is a yoga stretch that lifts the hips to activate the glutes and open the chest and hip flexors.',array['Letting knees flare outward','Overarching lower back','Not engaging glutes']::text[],array['Press through heels','Squeeze glutes at the top','Keep knees aligned','Avoid over-arching lower back']::text[],'Exhale as you lift hips, inhale as you lower down.',5.0),
('1160','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Burpee',array['cardiovascular system','quadriceps']::text[],array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves','shoulders','chest']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/burpee.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/burpee.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/burpee.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/burpee.jpg',array['Stand tall with your feet about hip-width apart.','Bend your knees, hinge at your hips, and place your hands on the floor in front of your feet.','Jump both feet back to a high plank with your body in a straight line.','Lower your chest to the floor, then press back up to plank.','Jump both feet forward to the outside of your hands.','Drive through your feet and jump straight up, reaching your arms overhead as you leave the floor.','Land softly and go straight into the next rep.']::text[],'cardio','intermediate',true,false,array['bodyweight burpee','squat thrust','push-up burpee','burpee jump','drop to plank jump','burpee']::text[],'A full-body bodyweight movement that combines a squat, plank, push-up, and jump for conditioning.',array['Hips sagging low in the plank or push-up.','Feet landing too narrow under the body.','Hands placed far in front of the shoulders.','Landing stiff-legged with no knee bend.']::text[],array['Keep your core braced.','Land softly under control.','Chest up on the jump.','Move as one straight line.']::text[],'Inhale as you drop down and move into plank, then exhale as you press up and jump.',8.0),
('1494','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Butterfly Yoga Pose',array['adductors','hip adductors']::text[],array['groin','lower back']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-butterfly-yoga-pose.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-butterfly-yoga-pose.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/stretching-butterfly-yoga-pose.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/stretching-butterfly-yoga-pose.jpg',array['Sit upright with feet together and knees bent out to sides.','Hold your feet with your hands.','Keep spine tall and shoulders relaxed.','Gently press knees toward the floor.','Hold the position, breathing deeply.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['butterfly stretch','bound angle pose','baddha konasana','Stretching - Butterfly Yoga Pose','butterfly yoga pose']::text[],'A seated stretch that opens the hips and groin by bringing the feet together and letting the knees fall outward.',array['Rounding the back','Bouncing knees','Forcing knees down']::text[],array['Keep chest tall','Relax the hips','Don''t force knees down','Engage core lightly']::text[],'Breathe evenly throughout the stretch.',3.8),
('0974','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Close Grip Lat Pulldown',array['lats','latissimus dorsi']::text[],array['biceps brachii','rhomboids','teres major','forearms']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-close-grip-front-lat-pulldown.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-close-grip-front-lat-pulldown.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-close-grip-front-lat-pulldown.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-close-grip-front-lat-pulldown.jpg',array['Attach a V-bar or close grip handle to the cable machine.','Sit down and secure your thighs under the pads.','Grasp the handle with a neutral grip, hands parallel.','Pull the handle down to the top of your chest, keeping torso vertical.','Slowly return the handle to the top without locking elbows.']::text[],'back','beginner',true,false,array['Close Grip Lat Pulldown','V-Bar Pulldown','Cable Lat Pulldown Close Grip','Cable Close Grip Front Lat Pulldown','band close-grip pulldown']::text[],'A cable exercise using a close grip to target the latissimus dorsi and supporting back muscles.',array['Leaning back excessively','Using momentum','Not fully engaging lats','Rounding shoulders forward']::text[],array['Lead with the elbows','Keep chest up','Do not swing back','Squeeze lats at bottom']::text[],'Exhale as you pull down, inhale as you return up.',6.0),
('0154','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Crossover Reverse Fly',array['delts','rhomboids']::text[],array['rhomboids','trapezius']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-crossover-reverse-fly.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-crossover-reverse-fly.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-crossover-reverse-fly.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-crossover-reverse-fly.jpg',array['Set both cable handles to the low pulleys and stand centered between them.','Grab the left handle in your right hand and the right handle in your left hand, then step forward to create tension.','Hinge forward slightly with a soft bend in your knees and keep your chest up and back flat.','Start with your arms angled down and crossed in front of you, elbows slightly bent.','Pull both arms out and back in a wide arc until your hands reach about shoulder height.','Squeeze your rear shoulders and upper back at the end position.','Return the handles slowly to the start without shrugging or changing your torso position.']::text[],'shoulders','intermediate',true,false,array['reverse cable fly','cable reverse fly','rear delt cable fly','cable rear delt fly','reverse fly machine cables','bent-over cable reverse fly','cable cross-over reverse fly','Cable Crossover Reverse Fly']::text[],'A cable rear-delt fly where you pull crossed low handles out and back to train the back of the shoulders and upper back.',array['Standing fully upright and turning it into a row','Bending and straightening the elbows during the rep','Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears','Swinging the torso to move the handles']::text[],array['Lead with your elbows','Keep a soft elbow bend','Chest up, back flat','Don''t shrug your shoulders']::text[],'Inhale as you return the handles to the start, and exhale as you pull your arms out and back.',6.0),
('0175','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Kneeling Crunch',array['abs','obliques']::text[],array['obliques']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-kneeling-crunch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-kneeling-crunch.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-kneeling-crunch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-kneeling-crunch.jpg',array['Attach a rope handle to the high pulley and kneel facing the machine.','Grab the rope ends and bring your hands beside your head with your elbows slightly forward.','Brace your midsection and keep your hips stacked over your knees.','Curl your ribcage toward your pelvis and bring your elbows down toward your thighs.','Pause briefly in the bottom position while keeping tension on the rope.','Slowly uncurl your spine and return to the start without letting the weight stack slam.']::text[],'waist','beginner',true,false,array['kneeling cable crunch','cable rope crunch','rope kneeling crunch','high cable kneeling crunch','kneeling ab crunch','cable abs crunch','cable kneeling crunch']::text[],'A kneeling cable ab exercise where you curl your torso downward against a high pulley to train the abs and obliques.',array['Pulling the rope down with the arms instead of curling the torso','Sitting hips back and turning it into a hip hinge','Jerking up and letting the weight stack drop between reps','Lifting the chest too high and losing abdominal tension at the top']::text[],array['Ribs to hips','Hips stay still','Curl, don''t hinge','Keep neck neutral']::text[],'Exhale as you curl down into the crunch, and inhale as you slowly return to the starting position.',6.0),
('0178','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Lateral Raise',array['delts','traps']::text[],array['traps','triceps']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-lateral-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-lateral-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-lateral-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-lateral-raise.jpg',array['Set the cable at the lowest position and stand side-on to it.','Grab the handle with the outside hand and let your arm hang by your thigh.','Stand tall with a slight bend in your elbow and brace your midline.','Raise your arm out to the side until your hand reaches shoulder height.','Pause briefly without shrugging your shoulder.','Lower the handle back down with control to the start position.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',false,true,array['cable lateral raise','cable side raise','single-arm cable lateral raise','cable delt raise','cable shoulder raise','side arm raise with cable']::text[],'A single-arm cable shoulder isolation exercise that raises the arm out to the side to target the lateral delts.',array['Shrugging the shoulder up toward the ear','Swinging the torso to lift the handle','Turning the raise into a front lift','Lifting the hand far above shoulder height']::text[],array['Lead with your elbow','Stop at shoulder height','Keep neck relaxed','Raise with control']::text[],'Exhale as you raise the handle to the side, and inhale as you lower it back down.',4.5),
('0186','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Lying Triceps Extension',array['triceps','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-lying-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-lying-triceps-extension.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-lying-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-lying-triceps-extension.jpg',array['Attach a rope handle to a low cable and place a flat bench in line with the pulley.','Lie face up on the bench with your head closest to the cable and hold the rope with a neutral grip.','Press the rope straight above your chest with your arms fully extended.','Keep your upper arms mostly still and bend your elbows to lower the rope toward your forehead.','Pause briefly when your elbows are deeply bent.','Straighten your elbows to return the rope to the start position above your chest.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['lying cable triceps extension','cable skull crusher','rope lying triceps extension','lying rope triceps extension','triceps extension on bench with cable','cable lying triceps extension']::text[],'A lying cable triceps exercise where you bend and straighten the elbows to move a rope handle over your chest.',array['Letting the elbows flare wide to the sides','Drifting the upper arms backward and turning it into a pullover','Lowering the rope behind the head instead of toward the forehead','Bouncing out of the bottom instead of controlling the cable']::text[],array['Elbows stay tucked','Upper arms stay still','Move only at the elbows','Finish with straight arms']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the rope toward your forehead, and exhale as you straighten your elbows back to the start.',4.5),
('0190','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable One Arm Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-one-arm-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-one-arm-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-one-arm-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-one-arm-curl.jpg',array['Stand beside the cable machine and hold the handle in one hand with your palm facing up.','Step out until the cable is taut, then stand tall with your elbow tucked against your side.','Curl the handle upward by bending your elbow without letting your upper arm drift forward.','Raise the handle until your forearm is close to your biceps, then briefly squeeze your arm.','Lower the handle slowly until your arm is straight again while keeping tension on the cable.','Complete all reps on one arm, then switch sides.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,true,array['single-arm cable curl','one-arm cable biceps curl','cable single arm curl','single hand cable curl','standing one-arm cable curl','one arm curl cable','cable one arm curl']::text[],'A single-arm cable biceps exercise where you curl a handle upward while keeping your elbow tucked at your side.',array['Elbow swings forward during the curl','Shoulder shrugs up toward the ear','Torso leans back to move the weight','Handle drops quickly on the way down']::text[],array['Keep elbow pinned','Palm stays up','Stand tall','Lower with control']::text[],'Exhale as you curl the handle up, and inhale as you lower it back down.',4.5),
('0162','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable One Arm Front Raise',array['anterior deltoid']::text[],array['trapezius','pectoralis major']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-one-arm-forward-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-one-arm-forward-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-one-arm-forward-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-one-arm-forward-raise.jpg',array['Attach handle to low pulley and stand facing away from machine.','Grasp handle with one hand, arm by your side.','With a straight arm, raise it forward to shoulder height.','Pause briefly at the top.','Lower back to the start slowly and repeat.']::text[],'shoulders','intermediate',false,true,array['cable front raise','single arm cable front raise','one arm anterior raise','Cable One Arm Forward Raise']::text[],'An isolation exercise that raises the arm forward using a cable to target the front deltoid.',array['Using momentum','Shrugging shoulder','Overextending at the top']::text[],array['Keep core tight','Lift with shoulder, not hand','Don''t swing','Control the descent']::text[],'Exhale as you lift, inhale as you lower.',4.5),
('2616','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable One Arm Lateral Pulldown',array['lats','latissimus dorsi']::text[],array['biceps','rhomboids']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-one-arm-lateral-pulldown.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-one-arm-lateral-pulldown.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-one-arm-lateral-pulldown.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-one-arm-lateral-pulldown.jpg',array['Attach a single handle to the high cable pulley.','Sit or stand, arm overhead grasping the handle.','Stabilize your body and engage your core.','Pull handle down to shoulder/upper chest level.','Pause, then return handle slowly.']::text[],'back','intermediate',true,true,array['single arm cable pulldown','one arm wide pulldown','cable unilateral lat pulldown','Cable One Arm Lateral Pulldown','cable lat pulldown with v-bar']::text[],'A vertical pulling exercise that targets the latissimus dorsi using a single cable handle.',array['Arching back excessively','Letting shoulder roll forward','Using momentum']::text[],array['Pull elbow down and in','Don’t shrug shoulders','Keep torso upright','Focus on the lats']::text[],'Exhale while pulling down, inhale while releasing.',6.0),
('0192','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable One Arm Lateral Raise',array['delts','traps']::text[],array['traps','triceps']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-one-arm-lateral-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-one-arm-lateral-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-one-arm-lateral-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-one-arm-lateral-raise.jpg',array['Stand sideways to the cable machine and grasp the handle with the outside hand.','Step away until the cable is taut, with your arm down by your side and a slight bend in your elbow.','Brace your torso and keep your shoulders level.','Raise your arm out to the side until your hand reaches about shoulder height.','Pause briefly without shrugging your shoulder.','Lower the handle back down with control to the starting position.','Complete the reps on one side, then switch arms.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',false,true,array['single-arm cable lateral raise','one-arm cable side raise','cable side raise','single arm delt raise','cable shoulder raise','cable one arm lateral raise']::text[],'A single-arm shoulder isolation exercise using a cable to lift the arm out to the side and target the lateral delts.',array['Shrugging the working shoulder toward the ear','Swinging the torso to start the rep','Turning the raise into a front raise','Lifting the hand far above shoulder height']::text[],array['Lead with the elbow','Keep shoulders level','Raise to shoulder height','Lower with control']::text[],'Exhale as you raise your arm to the side, and inhale as you lower it back down under control.',4.5),
('0861','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable One-Arm Twisting Seated Row',array['lats','latissimus dorsi']::text[],array['obliques','rhomboids','biceps brachii','posterior deltoid']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-one-arm-twisting-seated-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-one-arm-twisting-seated-row.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-one-arm-twisting-seated-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-one-arm-twisting-seated-row.jpg',array['Sit on the cable row bench and grasp a single handle with one hand.','Keep back straight and feet planted on the platform.','Pull the handle toward your torso while rotating your shoulder and upper body toward the working side.','Pause and squeeze your back muscles at contraction.','Slowly return arm and torso to the starting position with control.']::text[],'back','intermediate',true,true,array['one-arm seated cable row with twist','single-arm rotational cable row','cable unilateral twisting row','Cable One Arm Twisting Seated Row','cable seated row']::text[],'A unilateral cable row variation adding torso rotation to activate both the lats and core.',array['Over-rotating','Using momentum','Shrugging the shoulder']::text[],array['Rotate torso with row','Keep chest up','Avoid jerking','Control the return']::text[],'Exhale as you row and rotate, inhale as you extend and return.',6.0),
('0198','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Pulldown',array['lats','biceps']::text[],array['biceps','forearms']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-pulldown.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-pulldown.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-pulldown.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-pulldown.jpg',array['Adjust the seat and knee pad so your thighs are held down and you can reach the bar overhead.','Sit tall with your feet flat, grab the bar with an overhand grip just outside shoulder width, and straighten your arms.','Lean back slightly and pull your shoulders down away from your ears.','Drive your elbows down and pull the bar to the top of your chest.','Pause briefly while keeping your chest lifted and your torso still.','Slowly straighten your arms and let the bar rise under control to the start position.']::text[],'back','beginner',true,false,array['lat pulldown','cable lat pulldown','wide-grip pulldown','pulldown machine','lat pull down','cable pulldown']::text[],'A seated cable back exercise where you pull a bar from overhead to your upper chest to train the lats and upper arms.',array['Pulling the bar behind the neck','Swinging the torso backward to start the rep','Letting the shoulders shrug up at the top','Stopping short and not fully straightening the arms']::text[],array['Pull elbows to your ribs','Keep chest tall','Shoulders down, not shrugged','Control the way up']::text[],'Inhale as the bar rises, and exhale as you pull the bar down to your upper chest.',6.0),
('0203','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Rear Delt Row (with rope)',array['delts','trapezius']::text[],array['trapezius','rhomboids','biceps']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-rear-delt-row-with-rope.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-rear-delt-row-with-rope.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-rear-delt-row-with-rope.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-rear-delt-row-with-rope.jpg',array['Attach a rope to a low cable pulley and stand facing the machine.','Grab the rope with both hands, step back to create tension, and set your feet about hip-width apart.','Soften your knees and hinge forward slightly with a flat back and arms extended in front of you.','Lead with your elbows and row the rope up toward your upper chest while letting the rope ends separate.','Pause briefly as your elbows travel out and back and your shoulder blades squeeze together.','Lower the rope under control until your arms are extended again without rounding your shoulders.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',true,false,array['cable rear delt row','rope rear delt row','rear delt cable row','low cable rear delt row','rope face-away rear delt row','rear shoulder rope row','cable rear delt row (with rope)']::text[],'A cable rowing variation with a rope that targets the rear delts by pulling the elbows out and back.',array['Standing fully upright and turning it into a regular cable row','Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears during the pull','Pulling mostly with the hands and curling the rope in','Rounding the upper back as the rope returns forward']::text[],array['Lead with the elbows','Chest up, back flat','Pull shoulders back','Control the return']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the rope forward, and exhale as you row the rope toward your upper chest.',6.0),
('0194','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Rope Overhead Triceps Extension',array['triceps','triceps brachii']::text[],array['deltoids','forearms']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-rope-high-pulley-overhead-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-rope-high-pulley-overhead-triceps-extension.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-rope-high-pulley-overhead-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-rope-high-pulley-overhead-triceps-extension.jpg',array['Attach a rope to a high pulley.','Stand (or kneel) with back facing the machine.','Grasp rope, step forward, and lean slightly.','Keep upper arms still, extend elbows bringing rope forward/upward.','Return to starting position slowly.']::text[],'upper arms','intermediate',false,false,array['high pulley triceps extension','rope overhead extension','cable overhead triceps','Cable Rope High Pulley Overhead Triceps Extension','cable overhead triceps extension (rope attachment)']::text[],'An isolation exercise using a rope attachment on a high pulley to target the triceps overhead.',array['Moving upper arms','Flaring elbows','Arching or swinging back']::text[],array['Keep upper arms stationary','Elbows close','Extend fully','Avoid arching back']::text[],'Exhale as you extend, inhale as you bend elbows.',4.5),
('0200','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Rope Triceps Pushdown',array['triceps','triceps brachii']::text[],array['anconeus','forearms']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-pushdown-rope-attachment.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-pushdown-rope-attachment.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-pushdown-rope-attachment.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-pushdown-rope-attachment.jpg',array['Attach a rope to the high pulley and stand facing the machine.','Grab the rope with both hands, thumbs facing inward.','Keep elbows tucked at your sides and lean slightly forward.','Extend your arms down, splitting the rope at the bottom.','Slowly return to the start without letting elbows flare out.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['cable rope pushdown','rope triceps pushdown','triceps rope extension','cable triceps extension','Cable Pushdown (rope attachment)','cable pushdown (with rope attachment)']::text[],'A cable isolation exercise targeting the triceps by pressing a rope attachment downward.',array['Flaring elbows','Using momentum','Not fully extending arms']::text[],array['Keep elbows fixed','Split the rope at the bottom','Don’t use your shoulders','Full extension on each rep']::text[],'Exhale as you push down, inhale as you return.',4.5),
('0213','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Seated High Row (V-bar)',array['lats','biceps']::text[],array['biceps','rhomboids','rear deltoids']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-seated-high-row-v-bar.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-seated-high-row-v-bar.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-seated-high-row-v-bar.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-seated-high-row-v-bar.jpg',array['Sit at the cable row station facing the stack and grasp the V-bar handle with a neutral grip.','Plant your feet, soften your knees, and sit tall with your chest up and arms extended.','Brace your torso and pull your shoulder blades back and down.','Drive your elbows back and out slightly as you row the handle toward your upper stomach or lower chest.','Pause briefly with the handle close to your torso and your shoulders pulled back.','Extend your arms forward under control until your shoulders are stretched, then repeat.']::text[],'back','beginner',true,false,array['seated high cable row','v-bar seated cable row','close-grip high row','machine seated high row','cable high row with V handle','seated row to upper chest','cable seated high row (v-bar)']::text[],'A seated cable row using a V-bar handle, pulling toward the upper torso to train the lats, upper back, and biceps.',array['Rounding the lower back as the handle moves forward','Leaning far back and using body swing to pull','Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears','Pulling with the arms only and not moving the shoulder blades']::text[],array['Chest up','Lead with the elbows','Squeeze shoulder blades','Control the return']::text[],'Inhale as you extend your arms forward, and exhale as you row the handle toward your torso.',6.0),
('0226','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Standing Crunch',array['abs','obliques']::text[],array['obliques']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-standing-crunch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-standing-crunch.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-standing-crunch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-standing-crunch.jpg',array['Set a cable at the high pulley and stand facing away from the machine.','Hold the attachment by the sides of your head with both hands and bend your knees slightly.','Brace your midsection and keep your hips mostly still.','Curl your ribcage down toward your pelvis, bringing your elbows toward your thighs.','Pause briefly in the bottom position and squeeze your abs.','Slowly uncurl your torso back to the start without letting the weight stack slam.']::text[],'waist','beginner',false,false,array['standing cable crunch','cable crunch','high cable standing crunch','rope standing crunch','standing ab crunch with cable','cable standing crunch']::text[],'A standing cable ab exercise where you curl your torso downward against a high pulley to train the abs and obliques.',array['Hinging forward at the hips instead of curling the spine','Pulling the attachment down with the arms','Standing too upright and barely moving the torso','Letting the weight yank the torso back up']::text[],array['Ribs to hips','Keep hips still','Curl, don''t hinge','Brace your abs']::text[],'Inhale at the top, exhale as you curl down, and inhale again as you return under control.',4.5),
('1269','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Standing Fly',array['pectorals','pectoralis major']::text[],array['anterior deltoids','biceps brachii']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-standing-fly-crossover-fly.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-standing-fly-crossover-fly.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-standing-fly-crossover-fly.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-standing-fly-crossover-fly.jpg',array['Attach handles to both high pulleys.','Stand centered between pulleys, grasp handles in each hand.','Step forward into a staggered stance, arms outstretched.','With elbows slightly bent, bring handles together in front of chest.','Return slowly to starting position, feeling the stretch in the chest.']::text[],'chest','beginner',false,false,array['cable fly','crossover fly','standing cable chest fly','cable chest crossover','Cable Standing Fly, Crossover fly','cable standing up straight crossovers']::text[],'A cable isolation exercise for the chest, performed standing and moving arms in a hugging motion.',array['Over-extending arms','Letting elbows lock','Rounding the back']::text[],array['Lead with your elbows','Slight bend at elbows','Keep chest up','Don’t let shoulders roll forward']::text[],'Exhale as you bring hands together, inhale as you return.',4.5),
('0229','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Standing Inner Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-standing-inner-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-standing-inner-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-standing-inner-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-standing-inner-curl.jpg',array['Set a cable handle to the lowest position and stand facing the machine.','Grab the handle with one hand using an underhand grip and let your arm hang straight by your side.','Step back until the cable is taut, then stand tall with your feet about hip-width apart.','Keep your elbow pinned near your side and curl the handle up toward your shoulder.','Squeeze your biceps at the top without letting your upper arm drift forward.','Lower the handle slowly until your arm is straight again, then repeat before switching sides.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,true,array['cable standing inner curl','standing cable curl','single-arm cable curl','cable biceps curl','low cable curl','cable arm curl']::text[],'A single-arm cable biceps curl done standing with an underhand grip to train elbow flexion under constant tension.',array['Elbow drifts forward during the curl','Torso rocks back to move the weight','Wrist bends excessively instead of staying neutral','Letting the handle drop quickly on the way down']::text[],array['Keep elbow by your side','Curl, don''t swing','Stand tall','Control the lowering']::text[],'Exhale as you curl the handle up, and inhale as you lower it back down.',4.5),
('0230','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Standing Lift',array['abs','obliques']::text[],array['obliques','lower back']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-standing-lift.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-standing-lift.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-standing-lift.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-standing-lift.jpg',array['Set the cable handle to a low position and stand side-on to the machine with your feet about shoulder-width apart.','Hold the handle with both hands near the hip closest to the machine and straighten your arms with a soft bend in the elbows.','Brace your core and turn your chest slightly toward the handle without rounding your back.','Pull the handle diagonally up and across your body toward the opposite shoulder by rotating your torso and lifting your arms together.','Pause briefly at the top with your hips mostly facing forward and your arms extended.','Lower the handle back along the same diagonal path to the starting hip under control.','Complete all reps on one side, then turn around and repeat on the other side.']::text[],'waist','beginner',true,false,array['cable standing lift','standing cable lift','high-to-low cable lift','cable diagonal lift','cable wood chop lift','standing cable core lift']::text[],'A standing cable core exercise that lifts the handle diagonally across the body to train the abs and obliques.',array['Bending the elbows and turning it into an arm pull','Twisting the knees inward instead of rotating the torso','Leaning back or arching the lower back at the top','Letting the weight snap back down without control']::text[],array['Brace your core','Rotate through your torso','Keep arms long','Control the return']::text[],'Inhale at the start, exhale as you lift and rotate across the body, then inhale as you return under control.',6.0),
('0231','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Standing One Arm Triceps Extension',array['triceps','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-standing-one-arm-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-standing-one-arm-triceps-extension.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-standing-one-arm-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-standing-one-arm-triceps-extension.jpg',array['Stand side-on to the cable machine and grasp the handle with one hand.','Step away until the cable is taut, then raise your upper arm so it stays roughly parallel to the floor.','Bend your elbow to bring the handle toward the side of your head while keeping your upper arm still.','Extend your elbow to press the handle away until your arm is straight.','Pause briefly with your triceps tight, then return under control.','Complete all reps on one side, then switch arms.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,true,array['single-arm cable triceps extension','one-arm cable triceps extension','standing single-arm triceps extension','single-arm triceps pushdown','one-arm cable arm extension','cable triceps extension','cable standing one arm triceps extension']::text[],'A single-arm cable triceps isolation exercise done standing, extending the elbow while keeping the upper arm fixed.',array['Letting the elbow drift up and down during the rep','Turning the torso to help move the handle','Dropping the upper arm instead of keeping it level','Using momentum and snapping the cable back']::text[],array['Keep elbow still','Upper arm stays level','Straighten the arm fully','Move only at elbow']::text[],'Inhale as you bend your elbow and bring the handle in; exhale as you straighten your arm.',4.5),
('0238','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Straight Arm Pulldown',array['lats','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders','biceps']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-straight-arm-pulldown.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-straight-arm-pulldown.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-straight-arm-pulldown.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-straight-arm-pulldown.jpg',array['Attach a straight bar to a high cable pulley and face the machine.','Grab the bar with an overhand grip, step back slightly, and hinge forward a little at the hips.','Start with your arms straight in front of you at shoulder height and your torso braced.','Pull the bar down in a wide arc toward your thighs without bending your elbows.','Squeeze your lats at the bottom with the bar close to your hips.','Raise the bar back up slowly to shoulder height while keeping your arms long and your torso still.']::text[],'back','beginner',true,false,array['straight-arm pulldown','cable straight-arm pulldown','straight arm cable pulldown','lat prayer pulldown','straight-arm lat pulldown','straight-arm cable lat pull','cable straight arm pulldown']::text[],'A cable lat exercise where you pull a straight bar from shoulder height down to your thighs with mostly straight arms.',array['Bending the elbows and turning it into a triceps pressdown','Leaning back and using body swing to move the bar','Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears','Letting the bar drift away from the body at the bottom']::text[],array['Arms long, elbows soft','Pull with your lats','Ribs down, core tight','Stop at your thighs']::text[],'Inhale as the bar rises to the start, and exhale as you pull it down toward your thighs.',6.0),
('1723','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Triceps Pushdown',array['triceps','triceps brachii']::text[],array['anconeus','forearms']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-triceps-pushdown.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-triceps-pushdown.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-triceps-pushdown.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-triceps-pushdown.jpg',array['Stand facing the cable stack with attachment at high position.','Grip the bar or rope with both hands.','Keep elbows tight to your body.','Push the attachment down until arms are fully extended.','Return slowly to starting position.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['cable pushdown','triceps rope pushdown','straight bar pushdown','Cable Triceps Pushdown','cable one arm tricep pushdown']::text[],'An isolation cable exercise targeting the triceps by extending the arm downward against resistance.',array['Using too much weight','Letting elbows flare out','Leaning over the bar']::text[],array['Lock elbows at sides','Control the movement','Don’t let elbows drift','Squeeze triceps at the bottom']::text[],'Exhale as you push down, inhale as you return up.',4.5),
('0862','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cable Twist (up-down)',array['abs','obliques']::text[],array['obliques','lower back']::text[],'cable','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cable-twist-up-down.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cable-twist-up-down.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cable-twist-up-down.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cable-twist-up-down.jpg',array['Set the cable handle at about shoulder height and stand sideways to the machine with feet hip-width apart.','Grab the handle with both hands and extend your arms in front of your chest with a soft bend in your elbows.','Brace your core and rotate your torso away from the machine while guiding the handle diagonally down across your body.','Keep your hips mostly still and finish with your hands near the outside of your opposite hip.','Control the handle back to the start, then repeat all reps before switching sides or reverse the path to move from low to high.']::text[],'waist','beginner',true,false,array['cable twist up-down','high-to-low cable twist','low-to-high cable twist','standing cable torso twist','cable oblique twist','cable core rotation','cable twist (up-down)']::text[],'A standing cable rotation that trains the obliques by twisting the torso diagonally across the body.',array['Turning the hips and feet with the cable','Bending and straightening the elbows to move the weight','Letting the cable yank the torso back','Shrugging the shoulders toward the ears']::text[],array['Rotate through your ribs','Keep hips quiet','Move on a diagonal','Brace before you twist']::text[],'Exhale as you rotate and pull the handle across your body; inhale as you return under control.',6.0),
('1378','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Calf Stretch with Rope',array['calves','gastrocnemius, soleus']::text[],'{}'::text[],'band','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-calf-stretch-with-rope.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-calf-stretch-with-rope.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/stretching-calf-stretch-with-rope.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/stretching-calf-stretch-with-rope.jpg',array['Sit on the floor with one leg extended.','Loop a rope or band around the ball of your foot.','Hold ends of rope and gently pull your foot toward you.','Keep knee straight for a deeper stretch.','Hold the stretch and then switch legs.']::text[],'lower legs','beginner',false,false,array['rope calf stretch','band calf stretch','seated calf stretch with strap','calf muscle stretch with towel','Stretching - Calf Stretch with Rope','calf stretch with rope']::text[],'A static stretch for the calf muscles using a rope or strap to pull the foot into dorsiflexion.',array['Bending the knee','Jerking the rope','Holding breath']::text[],array['Keep knee extended','Pull gently','Don’t bounce','Relax into stretch']::text[],'Breathe deeply and relax throughout the stretch.',4.5),
('1599','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Calf Stretch with Strap',array['calves','gastrocnemius']::text[],array['soleus']::text[],'band','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-calf-stretch-with-strap.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-calf-stretch-with-strap.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/stretching-calf-stretch-with-strap.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/stretching-calf-stretch-with-strap.jpg',array['Sit with legs extended on the floor.','Loop a strap around the ball of one foot.','Hold strap ends and gently pull foot towards you.','Keep the knee straight and hold for desired time.','Switch sides and repeat.']::text[],'lower legs','beginner',false,false,array['seated calf stretch','strap-assisted calf stretch','banded calf stretch','Stretching - Calf Stretch with Strap','standing hamstring and calf stretch with strap']::text[],'A seated stretch using a strap or resistance band to elongate the calf muscles.',array['Bending knee','Pulling too hard','Letting back round']::text[],array['Keep knee straight','Flex foot toward you','Gentle pull, avoid jerking','Sit tall']::text[],'Breathe deeply and steadily throughout stretch; exhale gently as you deepen the stretch.',4.5),
('0248','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cambered Bar Lying Row',array['upper back','biceps']::text[],array['biceps','forearms']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cambered-bar-lying-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cambered-bar-lying-row.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cambered-bar-lying-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cambered-bar-lying-row.jpg',array['Place a barbell on the floor under the end of a flat bench and lie face down so your chest is supported with your arms hanging straight down.','Plant your feet on the floor, brace your midsection, and grab the bar with an overhand grip slightly wider than shoulder width.','Lift the bar clear of the floor and let it hang directly below your shoulders with your neck neutral.','Pull the bar up toward the underside of the bench or lower chest by driving your elbows back.','Pause briefly at the top and squeeze your shoulder blades together.','Lower the bar under control until your arms are straight and the bar returns just above the floor.']::text[],'back','intermediate',true,false,array['cambered bar lying row','lying barbell row','prone barbell row','chest-supported barbell row','seal row','barbell seal row']::text[],'A chest-supported barbell row performed lying face down on a bench to train the upper back with minimal body English.',array['Lifting the chest off the bench to move the bar','Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears','Yanking the bar off the floor with momentum','Flaring the elbows straight out to the sides']::text[],array['Chest stays on bench','Pull elbows back','Squeeze shoulder blades','Keep neck neutral']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the bar and exhale as you pull it up toward your chest.',6.0),
('drv-cardio-exercises','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cardio Exercise',array['cardiovascular system','heart and lungs']::text[],array['varies by movement']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cardio-exercises.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cardio-exercises.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cardio-exercises.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cardio-exercises.jpg',array['Select a cardio activity (running, jumping jacks, etc).','Warm up for 3-5 minutes.','Perform the chosen activity at a sustainable pace.','Maintain movement for set time or rounds.','Cool down and stretch afterwards.']::text[],'cardio','beginner',true,false,array['aerobic exercise','endurance training','cardio workout']::text[],'Any aerobic physical activity aimed at increasing heart rate and cardiovascular health.',array['Overexerting too soon','Neglecting form','Ignoring proper warm-up or cool-down']::text[],array['Keep chest up','Engage core','Use full range of motion','Breathe steadily']::text[],'Breathe rhythmically; exhale on exertion, inhale during lower intensity.',8.0),
('drv-cardio-exercises-machine','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cardio Machine Exercise',array['cardiovascular system','heart and lungs']::text[],array['varies by machine']::text[],'leverage machine',null,null,'https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/cardio-exercises-machine.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/cardio-exercises-machine.jpg',array['Choose your preferred cardio machine (treadmill, bike, etc).','Adjust resistance, incline, and settings as desired.','Begin with a brief warm-up.','Perform cardio at steady or variable intensity.','Cool down after session.']::text[],'cardio','beginner',true,false,array['treadmill cardio','elliptical session','rower cardio','stationary bike cardio']::text[],'Any sustained aerobic activity using a cardio machine to increase heart rate and endurance.',array['Slouching or poor posture','Using excessive resistance or speed','Neglecting warm-up or cool-down']::text[],array['Maintain upright posture','Relax shoulders','Use full range of motion','Control your breathing']::text[],'Breathe rhythmically according to intensity; exhale during exertion, inhale during recovery.',8.0),
('drv-cardio-exercises-machines','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Cardio Machine Workouts',array['cardiovascular system','heart and lungs']::text[],array['varies by machine (legs, glutes, arms)']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/cardio-exercises-machines.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/cardio-exercises-machines.jpg',null,null,array['Select a cardio machine suitable for your fitness level.','Adjust settings such as resistance, speed, and incline as desired.','Begin movement, focusing on steady pace and good posture.','Continue for your planned duration, monitoring intensity.','Cool down gradually and safely exit the machine.']::text[],'cardio','beginner',false,false,array['cardio machine routines','gym cardio machines','aerobic machine exercises']::text[],'Cardio exercises on machines like treadmills, bikes, ellipticals, or rowers improve cardiovascular fitness and endurance.',array['Poor posture','Jumping on or off quickly','Overexerting too quickly']::text[],array['Maintain upright posture','Use full range of motion','Monitor intensity','Keep steady pace']::text[],'Breathe steadily throughout the workout.',8.0),
('drv-chest-dips','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Chest Dips',array['pectorals','pectoralis major']::text[],array['triceps','anterior deltoids']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/chest-dips.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/chest-dips.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/chest-dips.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/chest-dips.jpg',array['Grip parallel bars and lift to start.','Lean torso forward and bend elbows.','Lower until upper arms are parallel to floor.','Pause at the bottom, feeling the stretch.','Push up through palms, returning to start.']::text[],'chest','intermediate',true,false,array['parallel bar dips','dips (chest focus)','weighted dips']::text[],'A compound bodyweight exercise performed on parallel bars to target the chest, shoulders, and triceps.',array['Staying too upright (triceps focus)','Going too deep','Flaring elbows excessively']::text[],array['Lean forward','Keep elbows out to sides','Descend under control','Avoid locking elbows at top']::text[],'Inhale as you lower, exhale as you press up.',5.0),
('drv-chest-lift-with-rotation','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Chest Lift with Rotation',array['rectus abdominis']::text[],array['obliques','hip flexors']::text[],'body weight',null,null,'https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/chest-lift-with-rotation.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/chest-lift-with-rotation.jpg',array['Lie on your back, knees bent, feet flat on floor.','Place hands behind head, elbows wide.','Engage core and lift head, neck, and shoulders off mat.','Rotate torso to one side while lifting.','Return to center and lower down; repeat on alternate side.']::text[],'waist','beginner',false,false,array['rotational crunch','oblique crunch twist','pilates chest lift with twist']::text[],'An abdominal exercise that combines a chest lift with torso rotation to target the obliques.',array['Pulling on neck','Using arms to assist','Lifting too high','Not engaging core']::text[],array['Twist from core','Don''t pull on neck','Elbows wide','Exhale on lift']::text[],'Exhale as you lift and rotate, inhale as you lower.',3.8),
('drv-stretching-chin-to-chest-stretch','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Chin-to-Chest Stretch',array['neck flexors','sternocleidomastoid']::text[],array['upper trapezius']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-chin-to-chest-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-chin-to-chest-stretch.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/stretching-chin-to-chest-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/stretching-chin-to-chest-stretch.jpg',array['Sit or stand with a straight back.','Gently lower your chin toward your chest.','Relax your shoulders and feel the stretch along your neck.','Hold the position for 15-30 seconds.','Slowly return to neutral.']::text[],'waist','beginner',false,false,array['chin to chest stretch','neck flexion stretch']::text[],'A gentle static stretch to release tension in the neck flexors by tilting the chin toward the chest.',array['Bouncing the stretch','Tensing shoulders','Overstretching the neck']::text[],array['Move slowly','Keep shoulders relaxed','Do not force the stretch','Hold gently']::text[],'Breathe deeply and evenly throughout the stretch.',3.8),
('0253','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Chin-ups (narrow parallel grip)',array['upper back','biceps']::text[],array['biceps','forearms']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/chin-ups-narrow-parallel-grip.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/chin-ups-narrow-parallel-grip.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/chin-ups-narrow-parallel-grip.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/chin-ups-narrow-parallel-grip.jpg',array['Grab the parallel handles with a narrow neutral grip and hang with your arms straight.','Cross your ankles or keep your legs still, then brace your midline and pull your shoulders down away from your ears.','Pull your elbows down and back to lift your chest toward your hands.','Keep pulling until your chin rises above your hands or handles.','Lower yourself under control until your arms are straight again.','Pause briefly at the bottom without relaxing your shoulders, then repeat.']::text[],'back','intermediate',true,false,array['neutral-grip chin-up','close neutral-grip pull-up','parallel-grip chin-up','narrow parallel pull-up','close-grip chin-up','assisted bodyweight chin-up','chin-ups (narrow parallel grip)']::text[],'A bodyweight vertical pull using a narrow parallel grip to train the upper back, biceps, and forearms.',array['Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears while pulling.','Swinging the legs or kipping to get upward.','Stopping short with the chin below the hands.','Dropping quickly to the bottom without control.']::text[],array['Drive elbows to ribs','Chest up to handles','Keep shoulders down','Lower with control']::text[],'Inhale at the bottom before you pull, exhale as you lift yourself up, and inhale again as you lower under control.',5.0),
('drv-close-feet-leg-press','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Close Feet Leg Press',array['quadriceps','quadriceps femoris']::text[],array['gluteus maximus','adductors','hamstrings']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/close-feet-leg-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/close-feet-leg-press.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/close-feet-leg-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/close-feet-leg-press.jpg',array['Sit in the leg press machine with feet close together on the platform.','Adjust seat and foot placement for comfort and safety.','Release safety handles and grip the handles for support.','Extend your knees to press the weight upward.','Lower platform slowly back to starting position.']::text[],'hips','intermediate',true,false,array['narrow stance leg press','platform narrow press']::text[],'A leg press using a narrow foot placement to emphasize the quadriceps.',array['Letting knees collapse inward','Allowing heels to lift','Shortening range of motion']::text[],array['Keep knees aligned with toes','Do not lock out knees','Lower with control','Keep back and hips against pad']::text[],'Exhale as you press up, inhale as you lower down.',6.0),
('2987','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Close Grip Chin-Up',array['lats','latissimus dorsi']::text[],array['biceps brachii','rhomboids','brachialis']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/close-grip-chin-up.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/close-grip-chin-up.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/close-grip-chin-up.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/close-grip-chin-up.jpg',array['Grab the pull-up bar with an underhand grip, hands shoulder-width or slightly closer.','Hang at full arm extension, engage your core and back.','Pull your chest towards the bar by driving your elbows down and back.','Clear the bar with your chin, pause briefly at the top.','Lower yourself with control until arms are fully extended.']::text[],'back','intermediate',true,false,array['close grip chinup','chinup close grip','narrow chin-up','supine pull-up','Close Grip Chin-up','weighted close grip chin-up on dip cage']::text[],'A vertical pulling exercise emphasizing the lats and biceps using a supinated close grip.',array['Using momentum','Flaring elbows out','Partial range of motion']::text[],array['Squeeze shoulder blades','Drive elbows down','Keep core tight','Avoid swinging']::text[],'Exhale as you pull up, inhale as you lower down.',5.0),
('0259','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Close-Grip Push-Up',array['triceps','triceps brachii']::text[],array['pectoralis major','anterior deltoid','core stabilizers']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/close-grip-push-ups.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/close-grip-push-ups.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/close-grip-push-ups.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/close-grip-push-ups.jpg',array['Begin in a plank position with hands close together under your chest.','Keep your core tight and body in a straight line.','Lower your chest toward the hands, elbows tucked by your sides.','Pause briefly at the bottom without touching the floor.','Press up to the starting position.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',true,false,array['triceps push-up','diamond push-up (if hands are closer)','narrow push-up','close hand push-up','Close Grip Push-ups','close-grip push-up']::text[],'A push-up variation with hands close together to emphasize triceps involvement.',array['Letting elbows flare','Sagging hips','Hands too wide']::text[],array['Tuck elbows','Keep hands under chest','Maintain straight body','Squeeze triceps at the top']::text[],'Inhale as you lower down, exhale as you push up.',5.0),
('drv-commando-pull-up','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Commando Pull-Up',array['lats','latissimus dorsi']::text[],array['biceps brachii','rhomboids','forearms','obliques','trapezius']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/commando-pull-up.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/commando-pull-up.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/commando-pull-up.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/commando-pull-up.jpg',array['Stand under a pull-up bar and grip it with hands facing each other, one in front of the other.','Hang with your body turned so the bar is directly in front of your face.','Brace your core and pull up, bringing your head to one side of the bar.','Lower yourself under control back to the starting position.','Repeat, bringing your head to the opposite side on the next rep.']::text[],'back','advanced',true,false,array['commando pullup','side-to-side pull-up','mixed grip pull-up']::text[],'A challenging pull-up variation using a parallel grip over the bar, emphasizing back, biceps, and grip strength.',array['Losing control at bottom','Letting body swing','Not clearing chin to side','Uneven pull strength']::text[],array['Keep body tight','Alternate sides','Control descent','Avoid swinging']::text[],'Exhale as you pull up, inhale as you lower down.',5.0),
('drv-stretching-crossover-kneeling-hip-flexor-stretch','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Crossover Kneeling Hip Flexor Stretch',array['hip flexors','iliopsoas']::text[],array['quadriceps','glutes']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-crossover-kneeling-hip-flexor-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-crossover-kneeling-hip-flexor-stretch.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/stretching-crossover-kneeling-hip-flexor-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/stretching-crossover-kneeling-hip-flexor-stretch.jpg',array['Start in a kneeling lunge with one knee on the ground and the opposite foot forward.','Tuck the pelvis under and shift your weight forward, feeling a stretch in the hip flexor of the rear leg.','Rotate your torso across the body, away from the back leg.','Hold for 20-30 seconds, breathing steadily.','Release and repeat on the other side.']::text[],'waist','beginner',false,true,array['kneeling hip flexor stretch','crossover lunge stretch','hip flexor crossover']::text[],'A kneeling stretch targeting hip flexors with the trunk rotated across the body.',array['Arching the back','Letting front knee collapse inward','Leaning forward excessively']::text[],array['Keep torso upright','Engage glutes','Rotate gently','Hips square']::text[],'Inhale to prepare, exhale as you rotate and deepen stretch.',3.8),
