('0302','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Decline Dumbbell Fly',array['pectorals','pectoralis major']::text[],array['anterior deltoids','biceps brachii']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-decline-fly-45-degree-1.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-decline-fly-45-degree-1.jpg',null,null,array['Set bench to 45-degree decline, secure feet.','Lie back, arms extended above chest, slight bend in elbows.','Lower dumbbells in a wide arc to sides.','Pause at bottom for a stretch.','Return dumbbells to starting position, squeezing chest.']::text[],'chest','intermediate',false,false,array['decline DB fly','dumbbell decline fly 45 degree','decline chest fly','Dumbbell Decline Fly (45 degree) (1)','dumbbell decline fly']::text[],'A fly movement on a 45-degree decline bench to isolate the lower chest with dumbbells.',array['Straightening arms','Dropping dumbbells too low','Using too much weight','Rushing the rep']::text[],array['Arms slightly bent','Big arc motion','Don''t overstretch','Squeeze at top']::text[],'Inhale as you open arms, exhale as you bring weights together.',4.5),
