('0294','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Biceps Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-biceps-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-biceps-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-biceps-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-biceps-curl.jpg',array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand, arms at your sides, and palms facing forward.','Brace your torso and keep your elbows close to your ribs.','Curl both dumbbells up toward your shoulders without letting your upper arms swing forward.','Pause briefly at the top and squeeze your biceps.','Lower the dumbbells back down under control until your arms are straight.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['dumbbell biceps curl','DB curl','dumbbell curl','standing dumbbell curl','two-arm dumbbell curl','arm curl with dumbbells']::text[],'A standing arm exercise where you curl dumbbells from your sides to your shoulders to train the biceps.',array['Swinging the torso to start the curl','Letting the elbows drift forward as the weights rise','Using partial range and not lowering fully','Bending the wrists back instead of keeping them neutral']::text[],array['Elbows pinned to sides','Curl, don''t swing','Squeeze at the top','Lower with control']::text[],'Exhale as you curl the dumbbells up, and inhale as you lower them back down.',4.5),
('0296','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Close-Grip Press',array['triceps','triceps brachii']::text[],array['pectoralis major','anterior deltoids']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-close-grip-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-close-grip-press.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-close-grip-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-close-grip-press.jpg',array['Lie flat on a bench with a dumbbell in each hand.','Hold dumbbells together above chest, palms in.','Lower dumbbells toward sternum, elbows tight to torso.','Pause when elbows reach 90 degrees.','Press dumbbells back up by extending arms.']::text[],'upper arms','intermediate',true,false,array['close grip dumbbell press','dumbbell triceps press','DB close grip bench press','narrow grip dumbbell press','Dumbbell Close Grip Press','dumbbell close-grip press']::text[],'A pressing movement with dumbbells held close together to emphasize triceps activation.',array['Flaring elbows out','Letting dumbbells drift apart','Arching back excessively','Lowering weights too far']::text[],array['Keep elbows close','Touch dumbbells together','Press through palms','Own the descent']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells, exhale as you press up.',6.0),
('0297','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Concentration Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-concentration-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-concentration-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-concentration-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-concentration-curl.jpg',array['Sit on a bench with your feet flat and knees apart, holding a dumbbell in one hand.','Lean forward slightly and brace the back of your upper arm against the inside of your same-side thigh near the knee.','Let your arm hang straight down with your palm facing up and your wrist neutral.','Curl the dumbbell toward your same-side shoulder without moving your upper arm.','Squeeze your biceps at the top when your forearm is nearly vertical.','Lower the dumbbell slowly until your elbow is fully extended, then repeat and switch sides.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,true,array['concentration curl','dumbbell concentration curl','seated concentration curl','single-arm concentration curl','one-arm biceps curl','elbow-on-thigh curl']::text[],'A seated single-arm biceps curl with the upper arm braced against the inner thigh to isolate the biceps.',array['Lifting the elbow off the thigh during the curl','Swinging the torso to help raise the dumbbell','Cutting the rep short and not fully lowering','Bending the wrist back instead of keeping it neutral']::text[],array['Keep elbow glued to thigh','Curl only at the elbow','Palm stays facing up','Lower with control']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbell and exhale as you curl it up.',4.5),
('0298','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Cross Body Hammer Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-cross-body-hammer-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-cross-body-hammer-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-cross-body-hammer-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-cross-body-hammer-curl.jpg',array['Stand tall holding a dumbbell in each hand at your sides with your palms facing inward.','Brace your torso and keep your elbows pinned close to your ribs.','Curl one dumbbell diagonally across your body toward the opposite shoulder without swinging.','Pause briefly near shoulder height while keeping your wrist straight and palm facing inward.','Lower the dumbbell back to your side under control.','Repeat on the other arm, alternating sides.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,true,array['cross body hammer curl','dumbbell cross-body hammer curl','alternating cross body hammer curl','cross-body DB hammer curl','across-the-body hammer curl','hammer curl to opposite shoulder','dumbbell cross body hammer curl']::text[],'A dumbbell curl variation where each hand travels across the body to the opposite shoulder with a neutral grip.',array['Swinging the torso or leaning back to lift the dumbbell','Letting the elbow drift forward away from the ribs','Twisting the wrist so the palm turns up at the top','Dropping the dumbbell quickly instead of lowering with control']::text[],array['Elbows stay tucked','Curl across, not straight up','Keep wrists neutral','Don''t swing the weight']::text[],'Exhale as you curl the dumbbell across your body, and inhale as you lower it back down.',4.5),
('0300','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Deadlift',array['glutes','hamstrings']::text[],array['hamstrings','lower back']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-deadlift.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-deadlift.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-deadlift.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-deadlift.jpg',array['Stand tall with your feet hip- to shoulder-width apart, holding a dumbbell in each hand in front of your thighs.','Brace your midsection, pull your shoulders back, and keep your arms straight.','Push your hips back and bend your knees slightly as you slide the dumbbells down close to your legs.','Lower until the dumbbells reach around mid-shin or just below your knees while keeping your back flat.','Drive through your feet and push your hips forward to stand back up with the dumbbells at your thighs.','Finish tall with your hips and knees straight, then repeat the hinge.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',true,false,array['DB deadlift','dumbbell DL','dumbbell Romanian deadlift','two-dumbbell deadlift','dumbbell hip hinge','dumbbells from the floor','dumbbell deadlift']::text[],'A hip-hinge lift with two dumbbells that trains the glutes, hamstrings, and lower back while lifting from standing to lockout.',array['Rounding the lower back as the dumbbells lower','Letting the dumbbells drift far in front of the legs','Squatting straight down instead of hinging the hips back','Locking the knees rigid or overbending them']::text[],array['Hips back first','Keep dumbbells close','Chest proud','Stand tall at top']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells with control, and exhale as you drive through your feet to stand up.',6.0),
('0308','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Fly',array['pectorals','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-fly.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-fly.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-fly.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-fly.jpg',array['Lie flat on a bench holding a dumbbell in each hand, and plant your feet on the floor.','Press the dumbbells above your chest with your palms facing each other and soften your elbows slightly.','Lower both arms out to the sides in a wide arc until your elbows reach about chest level.','Pause briefly at the bottom while keeping the same elbow bend.','Squeeze your chest and bring the dumbbells back together over your chest along the same arc.']::text[],'chest','beginner',false,false,array['dumbbell fly','DB fly','dumbbell chest fly','chest fly with dumbbells','lying dumbbell fly','dumbbell pec fly']::text[],'A lying chest isolation exercise where you open the arms wide with dumbbells, then bring them together in an arc over the chest.',array['Bending and straightening the elbows like a press','Lowering the dumbbells too far below chest level','Bringing the dumbbells together by shrugging the shoulders forward','Dropping the arms quickly instead of controlling the arc']::text[],array['Hug a wide barrel','Keep elbows softly bent','Lower with control','Squeeze chest at the top']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells out to the sides, and exhale as you bring them back together over your chest.',4.5),
('1277','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Fly On Exercise Ball',array['pectorals','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders','triceps']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-fly-on-exercise-ball.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-fly-on-exercise-ball.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-fly-on-exercise-ball.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-fly-on-exercise-ball.jpg',array['Sit on the exercise ball holding a dumbbell in each hand at your thighs.','Walk your feet forward and roll down until your head, neck, and upper back rest on the ball, then lift your hips so your torso is level.','Press the dumbbells above your chest with your palms facing each other and your elbows slightly bent.','Lower your arms out to the sides in a wide arc while keeping the same small bend in your elbows.','Stop when your upper arms are roughly in line with your torso and your chest feels stretched.','Bring the dumbbells back together over your chest along the same arc and squeeze your chest at the top.']::text[],'chest','intermediate',false,false,array['exercise ball dumbbell fly','stability ball dumbbell fly','Swiss ball chest fly','DB fly on ball','chest fly on exercise ball','dumbbell chest fly on ball','dumbbell fly on exercise ball']::text[],'A chest isolation move done on an exercise ball, lowering dumbbells in a wide arc and bringing them back together over the chest.',array['Letting the hips sag below the torso','Turning the movement into a press by bending the elbows too much','Lowering the dumbbells far below chest level','Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears']::text[],array['Keep hips up','Soft bend in elbows','Open wide, not too low','Bring bells together smoothly']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells out to the sides, and exhale as you bring them back together over your chest.',4.5),
('0310','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Front Raise',array['delts','biceps']::text[],array['biceps','trapezius']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-front-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-front-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-front-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-front-raise.jpg',array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand at your thighs, palms facing your legs.','Brace your torso and keep a soft bend in your elbows.','Raise both dumbbells straight in front of you until your hands reach about shoulder height.','Pause briefly without shrugging your shoulders.','Lower the dumbbells back to your thighs with control.','Repeat from a still, upright stance.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',false,false,array['front raise','dumbbell front raise','DB front raise','two-arm front raise','front shoulder raise']::text[],'A shoulder isolation exercise where you lift dumbbells straight forward from your thighs to shoulder height.',array['Swinging the dumbbells up with the hips or torso.','Lifting the weights higher than shoulder level.','Shrugging the shoulders toward the ears.','Bending the elbows more as the weights rise.']::text[],array['Lift to shoulder height','Keep ribs down','Lead with your hands','Don''t shrug up']::text[],'Exhale as you raise the dumbbells, and inhale as you lower them back down with control.',4.5),
('1760','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Goblet Squat',array['quads','glutes']::text[],array['glutes','hamstrings','calves']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-goblet-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-goblet-squat.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-goblet-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-goblet-squat.jpg',array['Stand tall with your feet about shoulder-width apart and hold one dumbbell vertically at your chest with both hands.','Brace your midsection and keep your elbows pointed down close to your body.','Sit your hips down and back while bending your knees, and lower until your thighs are parallel to the floor or slightly lower.','Keep the dumbbell tight to your chest and your feet flat as your knees track over your toes.','Drive through your whole foot to stand back up until your hips and knees are fully extended.','Reset your stance and repeat the next rep.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',true,false,array['goblet squat','DB goblet squat','dumbbell squat','front-loaded dumbbell squat','holding-a-dumbbell squat','dumbbell goblet squat']::text[],'A front-loaded squat holding one dumbbell at the chest to train the quads, glutes, and legs through a controlled deep squat.',array['Letting the dumbbell drift away from the chest','Heels lifting off the floor at the bottom','Knees collapsing inward during the squat','Folding the chest forward instead of staying upright']::text[],array['Chest up','Keep heels down','Knees track over toes','Hold the bell close']::text[],'Inhale as you lower into the squat, and exhale as you stand back up.',6.0),
('1330','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Hammer Grip Incline Bench Row',array['lats','latissimus dorsi']::text[],array['rhomboids','trapezius','posterior deltoid','biceps']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-hammer-grip-incline-bench-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-hammer-grip-incline-bench-row.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-hammer-grip-incline-bench-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-hammer-grip-incline-bench-row.jpg',array['Set an incline bench to 30-45 degrees and lie facedown with dumbbells.','Hold the dumbbells with palms facing each other (neutral/hammer grip).','Pull the dumbbells up toward your hips, elbows close to your body.','Pause and contract your back muscles at the top.','Lower the weights slowly with control.']::text[],'back','intermediate',true,false,array['Incline Dumbbell Neutral-Grip Row','Incline Bench Row Hammer Grip','Chest-Supported Neutral Row','Dumbbell Hammer Grip Incline Bench Row','dumbbell reverse grip incline bench one arm row']::text[],'A back-focused row performed chest-down on an incline bench with dumbbells and a neutral (hammer) grip.',array['Letting chest leave bench','Over-rowing with biceps','Shrugging shoulders']::text[],array['Chest on bench','Elbows tight','No shrugging','Full squeeze']::text[],'Exhale pulling up, inhale lowering down.',6.0),
('0314','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Incline Bench Press',array['pectorals','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders','triceps']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-incline-bench-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-incline-bench-press.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-incline-bench-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-incline-bench-press.jpg',array['Set an incline bench and sit back with a dumbbell in each hand resting on your thighs.','Lie back on the bench and bring the dumbbells to chest level with your palms facing forward.','Plant your feet on the floor and position your elbows slightly below shoulder height.','Press the dumbbells up over your upper chest until your arms are straight.','Lower the dumbbells under control to the sides of your upper chest.','Repeat by pressing back up along the same path.']::text[],'chest','intermediate',true,false,array['incline dumbbell press','DB incline press','incline bench dumbbell press','dumbbell incline chest press','incline chest press with dumbbells','dumbbell incline bench press']::text[],'A pressing exercise on an incline bench using dumbbells to train the upper chest, shoulders, and triceps.',array['Flaring the elbows straight out to the sides','Letting the dumbbells drift toward the face','Bouncing the dumbbells off the chest position','Arching the lower back off the bench']::text[],array['Keep wrists stacked','Drive feet into floor','Lower with control','Press over upper chest']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells, and exhale as you press them up.',6.0),
('0322','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Incline Biceps Curl',array['biceps','biceps brachii']::text[],array['brachialis','brachioradialis','forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-incline-biceps-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-incline-biceps-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-incline-biceps-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-incline-biceps-curl.jpg',array['Set the bench to a 45-60 degree incline and sit back with a dumbbell in each hand.','Let your arms hang fully extended at your sides, elbows near your body.','Curl the dumbbells up by flexing your elbows, keeping upper arms stationary.','Pause and squeeze your biceps at the top of the movement.','Lower the weights under control to the starting position.']::text[],'upper arms','intermediate',false,false,array['Incline Dumbbell Curl','Incline Bicep Curl','Dumbbell Incline Biceps Curl','dumbbell incline inner biceps curl']::text[],'An arm isolating curl performed seated on an incline bench to maximize stretch and activation of the biceps.',array['Swinging arms for momentum','Elbows drifting forward','Partial range of motion']::text[],array['Keep elbows still','Let arms fully extend','Do not swing weights','Squeeze at the top']::text[],'Exhale as you curl up, inhale as you lower down.',4.5),
('0318','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Incline Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-incline-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-incline-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-incline-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-incline-curl.jpg',array['Set an incline bench and sit back with a dumbbell in each hand.','Let your arms hang straight down under your shoulders with your palms facing forward.','Keep your upper arms still and curl the dumbbells toward your shoulders.','Pause briefly at the top and squeeze your biceps.','Lower the dumbbells slowly until your elbows are fully straight again.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['incline dumbbell curl','DB incline curl','incline biceps curl','seated incline curl','lean-back dumbbell curl','dumbbell incline curl']::text[],'A seated biceps curl on an incline bench that trains the biceps through a long range with dumbbells.',array['Swinging the dumbbells to start the curl','Letting the elbows drift forward as the weights rise','Stopping short instead of fully lowering the dumbbells','Bending the wrists back while curling']::text[],array['Keep elbows still','Palms stay forward','Lift with the biceps','Lower under control']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells and exhale as you curl them up.',4.5),
('0319','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Incline Fly',array['pectorals','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-incline-fly.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-incline-fly.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-incline-fly.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-incline-fly.jpg',array['Set an incline bench and sit with a dumbbell in each hand on your thighs.','Lie back and press the dumbbells above your upper chest with your palms facing each other.','Bend your elbows slightly and keep that bend locked in.','Lower the dumbbells out to your sides in a wide arc until they reach chest level or a gentle chest stretch.','Squeeze your chest to bring the dumbbells back together over your upper chest along the same arc.','Stop with the dumbbells nearly touching and repeat.']::text[],'chest','beginner',false,false,array['incline dumbbell fly','incline DB fly','dumbbell incline chest fly','incline chest fly','incline fly','incline dumbbell chest fly','dumbbell incline fly']::text[],'A chest isolation exercise done on an incline bench by opening the arms wide with dumbbells and squeezing them back together.',array['Bending and straightening the elbows like a press','Lowering the dumbbells far below chest level','Letting the dumbbells drift behind the shoulders','Clanging the dumbbells together at the top']::text[],array['Soft elbows, fixed angle','Open wide, not too low','Squeeze chest at the top','Keep shoulders down']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells out to the sides, and exhale as you bring them back together over your chest.',4.5),
('1278','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Incline Fly On Exercise Ball',array['pectorals','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-incline-fly-on-exercise-ball.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-incline-fly-on-exercise-ball.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-incline-fly-on-exercise-ball.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-incline-fly-on-exercise-ball.jpg',array['Hold a dumbbell in each hand and position your upper back on the exercise ball so your torso is angled upward.','Plant your feet firmly on the floor and raise the dumbbells above your upper chest with your palms facing each other.','Keep a soft bend in your elbows and lower your arms out to the sides in a wide arc.','Stop when your elbows are roughly level with your chest and you feel your chest stretch.','Squeeze your chest and bring the dumbbells back up along the same arc until they meet above your chest.']::text[],'chest','intermediate',false,false,array['incline dumbbell fly','DB incline fly','incline chest fly','incline dumbbell chest fly','dumbbell chest fly on ball','dumbbell incline fly on exercise ball']::text[],'A chest isolation exercise done with dumbbells while supported on an exercise ball at an incline angle.',array['Straightening the elbows and turning the move into a press','Lowering the dumbbells too far below chest level','Bouncing the hips or letting the ball roll around','Bringing the dumbbells up unevenly or clanking them together']::text[],array['Keep elbows slightly bent','Open wide under control','Lift through your chest','Feet planted, hips steady']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells out to the sides, and exhale as you bring them back together above your chest.',4.5),
('0320','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Incline Hammer Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-incline-hammer-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-incline-hammer-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-incline-hammer-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-incline-hammer-curl.jpg',array['Set an incline bench and sit back with a dumbbell in each hand.','Let your arms hang straight down by your sides with your palms facing each other.','Keep your upper arms still and curl both dumbbells toward your shoulders.','Stop when your forearms are nearly vertical and squeeze your biceps.','Lower the dumbbells slowly until your elbows are fully straight again.','Repeat without swinging your torso or letting your shoulders roll forward.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['incline hammer curl','dumbbell incline hammer curl','incline DB hammer curl','incline neutral-grip curl','seated incline hammer curl','lean-back hammer curl']::text[],'A seated incline curl with a neutral grip that targets the biceps and forearms while limiting body swing.',array['Swinging the dumbbells up with the torso','Letting the elbows drift forward during the curl','Turning the palms up at the top','Cutting the lowering phase short']::text[],array['Palms face each other','Keep elbows pinned','Lift, don''t swing','Lower under control']::text[],'Exhale as you curl the dumbbells up, and inhale as you lower them back down.',4.5),
('0321','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Incline Hammer Press',array['pectorals','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders','triceps']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-incline-hammer-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-incline-hammer-press.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-incline-hammer-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-incline-hammer-press.jpg',array['Set an incline bench and sit with a dumbbell in each hand on your thighs.','Lie back on the bench and bring the dumbbells to chest height with your palms facing each other.','Plant your feet, pull your shoulder blades back into the bench, and keep your wrists stacked over your elbows.','Press the dumbbells upward until your arms are straight above your upper chest.','Lower the dumbbells under control until they return to chest level with your palms still facing in.','Repeat the press without bouncing the dumbbells off your chest or shoulders.']::text[],'chest','beginner',true,false,array['incline hammer press','dumbbell incline hammer press','neutral-grip incline dumbbell press','incline DB hammer press','incline dumbbell chest press','incline press with palms facing in']::text[],'An incline dumbbell press with a neutral grip that trains the upper chest, shoulders, and triceps.',array['Flaring the elbows straight out to the sides','Letting the dumbbells drift back over the face','Banging the dumbbells together at the top','Arching the lower back and lifting the hips']::text[],array['Drive up over upper chest','Keep palms facing in','Pin shoulders to bench','Wrists stacked over elbows']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells to chest level, and exhale as you press them up.',6.0),
('0326','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Incline Rear Lateral Raise',array['delts','traps']::text[],array['traps','rhomboids']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-incline-rear-lateral-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-incline-rear-lateral-raise.jpg',null,null,array['Set an incline bench to about 45 degrees and hold a dumbbell in each hand.','Lie face down with your chest supported on the bench and let your arms hang straight below your shoulders.','Turn your palms to face each other and keep a soft bend in your elbows.','Raise both arms out and slightly back until they reach shoulder height.','Squeeze your rear shoulders and upper back at the top.','Lower the dumbbells with control back to the starting position.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',false,false,array['incline rear delt raise','dumbbell incline reverse fly','incline reverse fly','rear lateral raise','chest-supported rear delt fly','bent-arm rear delt raise','dumbbell incline rear lateral raise']::text[],'A chest-supported dumbbell raise that targets the rear delts by lifting the arms out to the sides on an incline bench.',array['Swinging the dumbbells up with momentum','Shrugging the shoulders toward the ears','Straightening the elbows into a wide row','Lifting the arms far past shoulder height']::text[],array['Lead with your elbows','Chest stays on the pad','Lift to shoulder height','Control the lowering']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells, and exhale as you raise them out to the sides.',4.5),
('0327','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Incline Row',array['upper back','biceps']::text[],array['biceps','shoulders']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-incline-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-incline-row.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-incline-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-incline-row.jpg',array['Set an incline bench to a moderate angle and lie face down with your chest supported and feet planted on the floor.','Hold a dumbbell in each hand with your arms hanging straight down and palms facing each other.','Brace your midline and pull your shoulders down and back.','Row the dumbbells up toward your lower ribs by bending your elbows and driving them back.','Squeeze your upper back at the top without lifting your chest off the bench.','Lower the dumbbells under control until your arms are fully extended again.']::text[],'back','beginner',true,false,array['incline dumbbell row','chest-supported dumbbell row','incline bench dumbbell row','DB incline row','chest-supported row','lying face-down dumbbell row','dumbbell incline row']::text[],'A chest-supported dumbbell row on an incline bench that targets the upper back while limiting body momentum.',array['Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears','Yanking the dumbbells with body momentum','Flaring the elbows straight out to the sides','Lifting the chest off the bench at the top']::text[],array['Lead with the elbows','Keep chest on the pad','Squeeze shoulder blades together','Lower with control']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells, and exhale as you row them up toward your ribs.',6.0),
('0329','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Incline Shrug',array['traps','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-incline-shrug.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-incline-shrug.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-incline-shrug.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-incline-shrug.jpg',array['Set an incline bench to about 45 degrees and sit with your chest supported against the pad.','Hold a dumbbell in each hand and let your arms hang straight down at your sides with your palms facing in.','Plant your feet firmly on the floor and keep your chest against the bench.','Lift your shoulders straight up toward your ears without bending your elbows.','Pause briefly at the top, then lower your shoulders back down under control.','Repeat from a dead hang each rep.']::text[],'back','beginner',false,false,array['incline dumbbell shrug','DB incline shrug','incline shrugs','dumbbell shrugs on incline bench','leaning dumbbell shoulder shrug','dumbbell incline shrug']::text[],'A chest-supported shrug on an incline bench using dumbbells to target the upper traps with minimal body momentum.',array['Bending the elbows and turning the rep into a row','Rolling the shoulders forward or backward at the top','Lifting the chest off the bench to move the weight','Using momentum and dropping quickly between reps']::text[],array['Arms stay long','Shrug straight up','Keep chest on pad','Lower with control']::text[],'Inhale at the bottom, exhale as you shrug your shoulders up, then inhale as you lower back down.',4.5),
('0330','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Incline Triceps Extension',array['triceps','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-incline-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-incline-triceps-extension.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-incline-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-incline-triceps-extension.jpg',array['Sit back on an incline bench holding a dumbbell in each hand.','Press the dumbbells overhead with your palms facing each other.','Keep your elbows pointed up and close to your head.','Lower the dumbbells behind your head by bending only your elbows.','Pause briefly when your forearms are below parallel to the floor.','Straighten your elbows to raise the dumbbells back overhead.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['incline dumbbell triceps extension','incline DB triceps extension','seated incline overhead triceps extension','incline dumbbell overhead extension','incline skull crusher with dumbbells','lean-back dumbbell triceps extension','dumbbell incline triceps extension']::text[],'A seated incline dumbbell triceps exercise where you bend and straighten the elbows to move the weights behind and above the head.',array['Elbows flare wide out to the sides.','Upper arms drift backward and turn it into a press.','Lowering only a few inches behind the head.','Arching the low back off the bench.']::text[],array['Elbows stay tucked','Upper arms stay still','Lower with control','Finish straight overhead']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells behind your head, and exhale as you extend your elbows to bring them overhead.',4.5),
('0332','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Iron Cross',array['delts','triceps']::text[],array['triceps','chest']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-iron-cross.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-iron-cross.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-iron-cross.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-iron-cross.jpg',array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides and your feet about hip-width apart.','Hold a slight bend in your elbows and turn your palms toward your sides.','Raise both arms out to the sides until your hands reach shoulder height.','Pause briefly with your shoulders level and your wrists in line with your elbows.','Lower the dumbbells back to your sides with control.','Repeat without swinging your torso or bouncing the weights.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',false,false,array['dumbbell iron cross','dumbbell lateral raise','DB lateral raise','side raise with dumbbells','dumbbell arm raise to the side']::text[],'A shoulder isolation exercise where you raise dumbbells out to the sides to train the delts.',array['Swinging the torso to start each rep','Shrugging the shoulders toward the ears','Lifting the dumbbells higher than shoulder level','Straightening the elbows completely and locking the arms']::text[],array['Lead with the elbows','Lift to shoulder height','Keep shoulders down','Move with control']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells and exhale as you raise them out to the sides.',4.5),
('0333','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Kickback',array['triceps','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-kickback.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-kickback.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-kickback.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-kickback.jpg',array['Stand with a dumbbell in each hand and hinge forward at the hips with a flat back.','Bend your elbows to about 90 degrees and pin your upper arms alongside your torso.','Brace your torso and keep your elbows still.','Straighten your arms by driving the dumbbells back until your elbows are fully extended.','Squeeze your triceps at the back of the movement.','Bend your elbows under control to return to the start position.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['triceps kickback','dumbbell triceps kickback','DB kickback','bent-over triceps extension','rear triceps kickback','dumbbell arm kickback','dumbbell kickback']::text[],'A bent-over triceps isolation exercise where you extend dumbbells behind you while keeping the upper arms still.',array['Swinging the dumbbells with the shoulders or torso','Letting the elbows drift away from the ribs','Dropping the upper arms during the set','Snapping the weights down instead of lowering slowly']::text[],array['Keep elbows glued in','Only move the forearms','Squeeze at full extension','Keep your back flat']::text[],'Inhale as you bend the elbows to the start position, and exhale as you straighten the arms back.',4.5),
('0334','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Lateral Raise',array['delts','traps']::text[],array['traps']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-lateral-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-lateral-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-lateral-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-lateral-raise.jpg',array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides, palms facing in.','Set your shoulders down and brace your midsection.','Raise both arms out to the sides until your hands reach about shoulder height, keeping a soft bend in your elbows.','Pause briefly at the top without shrugging your shoulders.','Lower the dumbbells back to your sides with control.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',false,false,array['lateral raise','dumbbell side raise','side delt raise','DB lateral raise','standing lateral raise','dumbbell lateral raise']::text[],'A shoulder isolation exercise where you lift dumbbells out to the sides to target the lateral delts.',array['Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears','Swinging the torso to heave the dumbbells upward','Lifting the hands well above shoulder height','Straightening the elbows and turning it into a front swing']::text[],array['Lead with your elbows','Stop at shoulder height','Keep shoulders down','Soft bend in elbows']::text[],'Exhale as you raise the dumbbells to the sides, and inhale as you lower them back down under control.',4.5),
('0336','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Lunge',array['glutes','quadriceps']::text[],array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-lunge.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-lunge.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-lunge.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-lunge.jpg',array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides and your feet hip-width apart.','Step one foot forward far enough that both knees can bend comfortably.','Lower your body until your front thigh is nearly parallel to the floor and your back knee drops toward the floor.','Keep your torso upright and your front foot flat as you pause briefly at the bottom.','Push through your front heel to return to standing.','Repeat on the other side, alternating legs each rep.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',true,true,array['dumbbell lunge','DB lunge','walking-in-place lunge with dumbbells','alternating dumbbell lunge','forward dumbbell lunge','dumbbell split step']::text[],'A lower-body exercise where you hold dumbbells and step into alternating lunges to train the glutes, quads, and legs.',array['Taking too short a step so the front knee shoots far past the toes.','Leaning the torso forward as you lower into the lunge.','Letting the front heel lift off the floor.','Pushing off the back foot instead of driving through the front leg.']::text[],array['Chest tall','Front heel stays down','Knees track over toes','Drop straight down']::text[],'Inhale as you lower into the lunge, and exhale as you push back to standing.',6.0),
('1729','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Lying Alternate Extension',array['triceps','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-lying-alternate-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-lying-alternate-extension.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-lying-alternate-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-lying-alternate-extension.jpg',array['Lie flat on a bench holding a dumbbell in each hand, and press both arms straight up over your chest with palms facing each other.','Keep one arm still above your chest as you bend the other elbow and lower that dumbbell beside your forehead.','Stop when your forearm points down and your upper arm stays mostly vertical.','Straighten the bent arm to bring the dumbbell back above your chest.','Repeat on the other side while keeping the first arm locked out.','Continue alternating sides with both shoulders and head resting on the bench.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,true,array['alternating dumbbell lying triceps extension','alternating dumbbell skull crusher','alternate DB triceps extension','lying alternating triceps extension','single-arm alternating skull crusher','lying dumbbell triceps extension','dumbbell lying alternate extension']::text[],'A lying triceps isolation exercise where you lower one dumbbell at a time toward your forehead and extend the elbow back to the top.',array['Elbows flare wide as the dumbbell lowers','Upper arms drift backward instead of staying upright','The non-working arm drops or bends','Turning it into a press from the chest']::text[],array['Elbows point to the ceiling','Only move at the elbow','Keep one arm locked out','Lower beside your forehead']::text[],'Inhale as you lower each dumbbell and exhale as you straighten the elbow to bring it back up.',4.5),
('0340','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Lying Hammer Press',array['pectorals','triceps']::text[],array['triceps','shoulders']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-lying-hammer-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-lying-hammer-press.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-lying-hammer-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-lying-hammer-press.jpg',array['Lie flat on a bench holding a dumbbell in each hand, and press the dumbbells above your chest with your palms facing each other.','Plant your feet on the floor and brace your torso while keeping your wrists stacked over your elbows.','Lower the dumbbells under control to either side of your chest, keeping your elbows slightly tucked from your shoulders.','Pause briefly when your upper arms reach bench level or the dumbbells lightly touch your chest line.','Press the dumbbells straight up until your arms are extended above your chest, keeping the palms facing each other throughout.','Bring the dumbbells back together over your chest and repeat.']::text[],'chest','beginner',true,false,array['dumbbell lying hammer press','neutral grip dumbbell bench press','neutral-grip dumbbell press','hammer grip dumbbell press','palms-in dumbbell chest press','dumbbell chest press with palms facing']::text[],'A flat bench dumbbell press done with a neutral grip to train the chest, triceps, and shoulders.',array['Elbows flare straight out to the sides.','Dumbbells drift toward the face instead of staying over the chest.','Wrists bend back under the dumbbells.','Lowering too fast and bouncing at the bottom.']::text[],array['Keep palms facing in','Tuck elbows slightly','Press over mid-chest','Keep wrists straight']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells to your chest and exhale as you press them back up.',6.0),
('0343','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Lying Leg Curl',array['hamstrings']::text[],array['gastrocnemius','glutes']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-lying-femoral.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-lying-femoral.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-lying-femoral.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-lying-femoral.jpg',array['Lie face down on a bench, legs straight, dumbbell held between your feet.','Hold onto the bench for stability.','Contract your hamstrings to curl the dumbbell upward toward your glutes.','Pause at the top of the movement.','Lower the dumbbell in a controlled motion to the starting position.']::text[],'upper legs','intermediate',false,false,array['Lying Dumbbell Leg Curl','Dumbbell Hamstring Curl','Lying Femoral Curl','Dumbbell Lying Femoral','dumbbell lying one arm press']::text[],'A hamstring isolation exercise where a dumbbell is held between the feet during leg curls.',array['Allowing hips to lift','Letting dumbbell slip','Using momentum']::text[],array['Keep hips down','Squeeze at top','Control the descent','Engage hamstrings']::text[],'Exhale as you curl up, inhale as you lower down.',4.5),
('1328','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Lying Rear Delt Row',array['upper back','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders','biceps']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-lying-rear-delt-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-lying-rear-delt-row.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-lying-rear-delt-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-lying-rear-delt-row.jpg',array['Lie face down on a flat bench holding a dumbbell in each hand, with your chest supported and arms hanging straight down.','Set your feet firmly on the floor and turn your palms to face each other.','Pull your elbows out to the sides and row the dumbbells up toward your upper chest.','Squeeze your upper back at the top while keeping your chest on the bench.','Lower the dumbbells back down under control until your arms are straight again.','Repeat without swinging the weights or shrugging your shoulders.']::text[],'back','beginner',true,false,array['rear delt row','dumbbell rear delt row','prone rear delt row','chest-supported rear delt row','lying dumbbell rear row','face-down dumbbell row','dumbbell lying rear delt row']::text[],'A chest-supported dumbbell row variation that targets the rear delts and upper back by pulling the elbows out wide.',array['Pulling the elbows close to the ribs like a regular row','Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears','Lifting the chest off the bench to move the weights','Swinging the dumbbells instead of lowering them with control']::text[],array['Lead with the elbows','Chest stays on the bench','Pull wide, not low','Squeeze shoulder blades together']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells, and exhale as you row them up toward your upper chest.',6.0),
('0351','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Lying Triceps Extension',array['triceps','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-lying-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-lying-triceps-extension.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-lying-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-lying-triceps-extension.jpg',array['Lie flat on a bench holding a dumbbell in each hand, and press the dumbbells above your chest with your palms facing each other.','Pull your shoulders down into the bench and straighten your wrists so the dumbbells stay stacked over your elbows.','Bend your elbows and lower the dumbbells toward the sides of your forehead while keeping your upper arms mostly still.','Stop when your elbows are fully bent and the dumbbells are close to your head.','Straighten your elbows to drive the dumbbells back to the start position above your chest.','Repeat each rep without letting your elbows flare wide.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['lying triceps extension','dumbbell skull crusher','DB skull crusher','lying dumbbell triceps extension','lying triceps dumbbell press','triceps extension lying down','dumbbell lying triceps extension']::text[],'A lying dumbbell triceps exercise where you bend and straighten the elbows to lower the weights toward the forehead and press them back up.',array['Elbows flare out wide as the dumbbells lower.','Upper arms drift backward or forward during the rep.','Dumbbells drop too low behind the head instead of beside the forehead.','Wrists bend back instead of staying straight.']::text[],array['Keep elbows tucked','Upper arms stay still','Bend only at elbows','Stack wrists over elbows']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells toward your forehead, and exhale as you extend your elbows to raise them back up.',4.5),
('0355','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell One Arm Lateral Raise',array['delts','trapezius']::text[],array['trapezius','triceps']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-one-arm-lateral-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-one-arm-lateral-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-one-arm-lateral-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-one-arm-lateral-raise.jpg',array['Stand tall with feet about hip-width apart and hold a dumbbell at one side with a slight bend in your elbow.','Brace your core and keep your shoulders level as your free arm stays relaxed by your side or on your hip.','Lift the dumbbell out to the side until your hand reaches about shoulder height.','Pause briefly at the top without shrugging your shoulder toward your ear.','Lower the dumbbell back to your side with control.','Complete all reps on one arm, then switch sides.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',false,true,array['one-arm lateral raise','single-arm dumbbell lateral raise','single arm side raise','dumbbell side raise','single-arm delt raise','dumbbell one arm lateral raise']::text[],'A single-arm shoulder isolation exercise where you raise a dumbbell out to the side to train the lateral delts.',array['Shrugging the working shoulder up toward the ear','Swinging the torso or leaning to start the lift','Raising the dumbbell higher than shoulder height','Locking the elbow completely straight']::text[],array['Lead with your elbow','Stop at shoulder height','Keep shoulders level','Lower with control']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbell, and exhale as you lift it out to the side.',4.5),
('1672','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell One Arm Zottman Preacher Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-one-arm-zottman-preacher-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-one-arm-zottman-preacher-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-one-arm-zottman-preacher-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-one-arm-zottman-preacher-curl.jpg',array['Sit at a preacher bench and plant your feet on the floor.','Hold a dumbbell in one hand and place the back of your upper arm flat against the pad with your arm nearly straight.','Start with your palm facing up and curl the dumbbell toward your shoulder without lifting your upper arm off the pad.','Pause near the top and rotate your wrist until your palm faces down.','Lower the dumbbell slowly until your arm is nearly straight while keeping your palm facing down.','Rotate your wrist back to palm-up at the bottom and repeat before switching arms.']::text[],'upper arms','intermediate',false,true,array['one-arm Zottman preacher curl','single-arm dumbbell Zottman preacher curl','DB one arm preacher curl','single-arm preacher curl with rotation','one-arm biceps curl on preacher bench','dumbbell one arm zottman preacher curl']::text[],'A single-arm preacher curl variation that adds a wrist rotation to train the biceps and forearms through both the lift and lowering phase.',array['Upper arm lifting off the preacher pad','Swinging the dumbbell instead of curling it','Dropping the weight quickly on the lowering phase','Rotating the wrist too early before reaching the top']::text[],array['Keep arm glued to pad','Curl, then rotate','Lower slowly on the way down','Keep wrist movement controlled']::text[],'Exhale as you curl the dumbbell up, then inhale as you rotate and lower it back down.',4.5),
('0306','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell One-Arm Triceps Extension',array['triceps','triceps brachii']::text[],array['anconeus','forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-one-arm-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-one-arm-triceps-extension.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-one-arm-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-one-arm-triceps-extension.jpg',array['Hold dumbbell in one hand, arm extended overhead.','Support upper arm with free hand if needed.','Lower dumbbell behind head by bending the elbow.','Pause when forearm is parallel to ground.','Extend arm fully to return to starting position.']::text[],'upper arms','intermediate',false,true,array['one arm DB triceps extension','single arm dumbbell overhead extension','one-arm overhead triceps','Dumbbell One Arm Triceps Extension','dumbbell decline triceps extension']::text[],'An isolation exercise for the triceps performed one arm at a time, with a dumbbell overhead.',array['Moving upper arm','Dropping weight too far','Allowing elbow to flare','Rushing movement']::text[],array['Keep upper arm vertical','Only move forearm','No swinging','Full elbow extension']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbell, exhale as you press up.',4.5),
('0369','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Over Bench Wrist Curl',array['forearms','biceps']::text[],array['biceps','brachialis']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-over-bench-wrist-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-over-bench-wrist-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-over-bench-wrist-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-over-bench-wrist-curl.jpg',array['Sit at a bench and place your forearms on top with your palms facing up.','Hold a dumbbell in each hand and slide forward until your wrists hang just past the bench edge.','Let your hands lower to gently stretch your wrists at the bottom.','Curl your wrists up by lifting your knuckles toward your forearms.','Squeeze your forearms briefly at the top.','Lower the dumbbells back down under control until your wrists extend again.']::text[],'lower arms','beginner',false,false,array['dumbbell wrist curl','over-bench wrist curl','bench wrist curl','seated dumbbell wrist curl','forearm curl with dumbbells','dumbbell over bench wrist curl']::text[],'A seated forearm isolation exercise where the wrists curl dumbbells upward with the forearms supported on a bench.',array['Lifting the forearms off the bench during the curl.','Swinging the dumbbells instead of moving only the wrists.','Using partial range and stopping before the wrists fully lower.','Bending the elbows to help raise the weight.']::text[],array['Move only your wrists','Forearms stay glued down','Curl through full range','Lower slowly']::text[],'Inhale as you lower your wrists and exhale as you curl them up.',4.5),
('1329','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Palm Rotational Bent Over Row',array['upper back','biceps']::text[],array['biceps','forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-palm-rotational-bent-over-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-palm-rotational-bent-over-row.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-palm-rotational-bent-over-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-palm-rotational-bent-over-row.jpg',array['Stand with your feet hip-width apart, holding a dumbbell in each hand with your arms straight and palms facing each other.','Hinge at your hips until your torso is leaned forward, soften your knees, and keep your back flat.','Let the dumbbells hang below your shoulders and brace your core.','Row both dumbbells toward your lower ribs by driving your elbows back.','Rotate your palms as you lift until they face more backward or away from your body at the top.','Pause and squeeze your upper back, then lower the dumbbells with control as you rotate your palms back to neutral.']::text[],'back','intermediate',true,false,array['dumbbell palm rotational bent-over row','rotating dumbbell bent-over row','dumbbell twist row','pronating dumbbell row','bent-over dumbbell row with rotation','twisting bent-over row','dumbbell palm rotational bent over row']::text[],'A bent-over dumbbell row where you rotate your palms during the pull to train the upper back, biceps, and forearms.',array['Rounding the lower back as you hinge forward','Standing up taller to swing the dumbbells','Shrugging the shoulders toward the ears','Letting the wrists curl instead of rotating the forearms']::text[],array['Keep your back flat','Drive elbows back','Rotate through the pull','Squeeze shoulder blades together']::text[],'Inhale at the bottom, exhale as you row and rotate the dumbbells up, then inhale as you lower them back down.',6.0),
('1673','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Preacher Curl Over Exercise Ball',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-preacher-curl-over-exercise-ball.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-preacher-curl-over-exercise-ball.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-preacher-curl-over-exercise-ball.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-preacher-curl-over-exercise-ball.jpg',array['Sit tall on the exercise ball with both feet flat and spread for balance.','Hold a dumbbell in one hand with your palm facing up and brace the back of your upper arm against the ball.','Let the arm straighten almost fully so the dumbbell hangs below your elbow.','Curl the dumbbell toward your shoulder without lifting your elbow off the ball.','Squeeze your biceps at the top while keeping your wrist straight.','Lower the dumbbell slowly until your arm is almost straight, then repeat and switch sides.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,true,array['dumbbell preacher curl on ball','exercise ball preacher curl','single-arm dumbbell preacher curl','one-arm preacher curl','biceps curl with elbow on ball','dumbbell preacher curl over exercise ball']::text[],'A single-arm biceps curl done with the upper arm braced against an exercise ball to limit cheating and isolate the elbow flexors.',array['Elbow slides or lifts off the ball during the curl.','Shoulder rolls forward to help raise the dumbbell.','Wrist bends back or curls inward at the top.','Body rocks on the ball to create momentum.']::text[],array['Keep elbow glued down','Curl only at the elbow','Keep wrist straight','Lower under control']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbell and exhale as you curl it up.',4.5),
('0373','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Pronate-grip Triceps Extension',array['triceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-pronate-grip-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-pronate-grip-triceps-extension.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-pronate-grip-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-pronate-grip-triceps-extension.jpg',array['Sit tall on a bench or chair with both feet flat on the floor.','Hold one dumbbell with both hands by the handle using an overhand grip and press it straight overhead.','Bring your upper arms close to your ears and point your elbows forward.','Lower the dumbbell behind your head by bending only your elbows.','Stop when your forearms are below parallel and your upper arms stay mostly still.','Straighten your elbows to raise the dumbbell back to the overhead start position.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['overhead dumbbell triceps extension','two-hand overhead triceps extension','pronated-grip dumbbell triceps extension','seated overhead triceps extension','dumbbell triceps extension','overhead triceps press','dumbbell pronate-grip triceps extension']::text[],'A seated overhead triceps exercise using one dumbbell held with both hands to bend and straighten the elbows.',array['Elbows flare wide out to the sides.','Upper arms drift backward and move during the rep.','Lower back arches as the weight goes overhead.','The dumbbell drops too low and bumps the upper back.']::text[],array['Elbows stay close in','Upper arms stay still','Brace your ribs down','Lock out overhead']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbell behind your head, and exhale as you straighten your elbows to lift it overhead.',4.5),
('0374','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Prone Incline Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-prone-incline-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-prone-incline-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-prone-incline-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-prone-incline-curl.jpg',array['Set an incline bench to about 45 degrees and lie face down with your chest supported.','Hold a dumbbell in each hand with your arms hanging straight down and palms facing forward.','Keep your upper arms still and curl both dumbbells up toward your shoulders.','Pause briefly at the top and squeeze your biceps.','Lower the dumbbells slowly until your arms are fully extended again.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['dumbbell prone incline curl','prone incline dumbbell curl','incline face-down dumbbell curl','chest-supported dumbbell curl','incline dumbbell biceps curl']::text[],'A chest-supported biceps curl on an incline bench that limits body swing and keeps tension on the arms.',array['Lifting the chest off the bench to swing the weights','Letting the elbows drift forward during the curl','Cutting the rep short and not fully lowering the dumbbells','Bending the wrists back instead of keeping them neutral']::text[],array['Keep chest on bench','Elbows stay still','Curl through full range','Lower with control']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells and exhale as you curl them up.',4.5),
('0377','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Rear Delt Row',array['delts','trapezius']::text[],array['trapezius','rhomboids']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-rear-delt-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-rear-delt-row.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-rear-delt-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-rear-delt-row.jpg',array['Stand with your feet hip- to shoulder-width apart, holding a dumbbell in each hand at your sides.','Hinge at your hips until your torso is leaned forward, soften your knees, and let the dumbbells hang below your shoulders with your palms facing each other.','Brace your core and keep your back flat as you pull your elbows up and out to the sides.','Lift until your upper arms are roughly in line with your shoulders and squeeze your upper back.','Lower the dumbbells under control to the start position and repeat.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',true,false,array['dumbbell rear delt row','rear delt dumbbell row','bent-over rear delt row','rear shoulder dumbbell row','bent-over dumbbell rear fly row']::text[],'A bent-over dumbbell row variation that targets the rear delts by pulling the elbows out wide to the sides.',array['Rounding the lower back as you hinge forward.','Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears.','Pulling the dumbbells straight back close to the ribs.','Swinging the torso to start each rep.']::text[],array['Lead with your elbows.','Keep your back flat.','Raise arms out, not back.','Squeeze shoulder blades together.']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbells, and exhale as you row them up and out to the sides.',6.0),
('1379','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Seated Calf Raise',array['calves','hamstrings']::text[],array['hamstrings']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-seated-calf-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-seated-calf-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-seated-calf-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-seated-calf-raise.jpg',array['Sit on a bench or chair with your knees bent and place the balls of your feet on a small raised surface with your heels hanging off.','Set a dumbbell across the tops of your thighs just above your knees and hold it steady with both hands.','Let your heels drop down until you feel a stretch through your calves.','Press through the balls of your feet and raise your heels as high as you can.','Pause briefly at the top while keeping the dumbbell steady.','Lower your heels back down under control and repeat.']::text[],'lower legs','beginner',false,false,array['seated dumbbell calf raise','DB seated calf raise','seated calf raise with dumbbell','seated heel raise','seated calf lift','dumbbell seated calf raise']::text[],'A seated calf exercise using a dumbbell on the thighs to train ankle plantarflexion through a full range of motion.',array['Bouncing the heels at the bottom instead of lowering under control.','Rolling the ankles inward or outward as the heels rise.','Placing the dumbbell too close to the knees so it slides during the set.','Using a very short range of motion and not dropping the heels below the step.']::text[],array['Drive through big toe','Lift heels straight up','Use full ankle range','Control the lowering']::text[],'Inhale as you lower your heels, and exhale as you press up onto the balls of your feet.',4.5),
('0392','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Seated Front Raise',array['delts','trapezius']::text[],array['trapezius','biceps']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-seated-front-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-seated-front-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-seated-front-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-seated-front-raise.jpg',array['Sit tall on a bench with your feet flat on the floor and a dumbbell in each hand at your sides.','Hold the dumbbells with your palms facing down or slightly toward each other, and brace your midsection.','Raise both arms straight forward until the dumbbells reach shoulder height.','Pause briefly at the top without leaning back or shrugging your shoulders.','Lower the dumbbells under control back to the starting position by your thighs.','Repeat each rep with the same seated posture and arm path.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',false,false,array['seated dumbbell front raise','DB seated front raise','dumbbell front raise seated','seated shoulder front raise','seated arm raise','dumbbell seated front raise']::text[],'A seated shoulder isolation exercise where you lift dumbbells straight in front to shoulder height to train the front delts.',array['Leaning the torso back to swing the dumbbells up','Raising the dumbbells above shoulder height','Shrugging the shoulders toward the ears','Dropping the weights quickly on the way down']::text[],array['Lift to shoulder height','Keep torso still','Soft bend in elbows','Shoulders down and back']::text[],'Exhale as you raise the dumbbells, and inhale as you lower them back down under control.',4.5),
('0394','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Seated Kickback',array['triceps','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-seated-kickback.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-seated-kickback.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-seated-kickback.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-seated-kickback.jpg',array['Sit on a bench holding a dumbbell in each hand with your feet flat on the floor.','Hinge forward from your hips and keep your back flat with your chest angled toward your thighs.','Pull your elbows up beside your torso and bend them to about 90 degrees.','Keep your upper arms still and straighten your elbows to kick the dumbbells back behind you.','Squeeze your triceps with your arms fully extended.','Bend your elbows slowly to return the dumbbells to the start position.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['seated dumbbell triceps kickback','DB seated kickback','seated triceps kickback','dumbbell kickback','seated arm kickback','dumbbell seated kickback']::text[],'A seated triceps isolation exercise where you hinge forward and extend dumbbells back by straightening the elbows.',array['Swinging the dumbbells with the shoulders','Letting the elbows drift away from the torso','Dropping the upper arms during the rep','Rounding the back while leaning forward']::text[],array['Keep elbows glued in','Only move the forearms','Back flat, chest up','Squeeze at full extension']::text[],'Inhale as you bend your elbows to lower the dumbbells, and exhale as you straighten your arms back.',4.5),
('0396','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Seated Lateral Raise',array['delts','traps']::text[],array['traps','upper back']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-seated-lateral-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-seated-lateral-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-seated-lateral-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-seated-lateral-raise.jpg',array['Sit upright on a bench with your feet flat on the floor and a dumbbell in each hand at your sides.','Set your shoulders down and keep a soft bend in your elbows.','Raise both arms out to your sides until the dumbbells reach about shoulder height.','Pause briefly at the top without shrugging your shoulders.','Lower the dumbbells back to your sides with control and repeat.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',false,false,array['seated lateral raise','dumbbell lateral raise','seated dumbbell lateral raise','DB seated lateral raise','seated side raise','seated shoulder side raise','dumbbell seated lateral raise']::text[],'A seated shoulder isolation exercise where you raise dumbbells out to the sides to target the delts.',array['Swinging the torso to start the lift','Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears','Lifting the dumbbells higher than shoulder level','Straightening the elbows into a stiff arm']::text[],array['Lead with your elbows','Keep shoulders down','Lift to shoulder height','Control the lowering']::text[],'Exhale as you raise the dumbbells out to the sides, and inhale as you lower them back down.',4.5),
('0397','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Seated Neutral Wrist Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-seated-neutral-wrist-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-seated-neutral-wrist-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-seated-neutral-wrist-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-seated-neutral-wrist-curl.jpg',array['Sit on a bench with your feet flat and hold a dumbbell in each hand with your palms facing each other.','Rest your forearms on your thighs near your knees and let your wrists hang just past your knees.','Start with your wrists straight and your hands hanging down under control.','Curl the dumbbells upward by bending only at your wrists while keeping your forearms pressed into your thighs.','Squeeze briefly at the top without turning your palms up or down.','Lower the dumbbells slowly back to the start until your wrists are fully extended.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['seated neutral wrist curl','dumbbell neutral-grip wrist curl','hammer wrist curl','seated forearm curl','neutral dumbbell wrist curl','dumbbell seated neutral wrist curl']::text[],'A seated forearm isolation exercise where you curl dumbbells by bending at the wrists with a neutral grip.',array['Lifting the forearms off the thighs to swing the dumbbells up','Turning the palms up or down during the curl','Bouncing the dumbbells at the bottom','Using the shoulders or elbows to help the movement']::text[],array['Move only your wrists','Keep palms facing in','Forearms stay glued down','Control the lowering']::text[],'Exhale as you curl your wrists up, and inhale as you lower the dumbbells back down.',4.5),
('0402','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Seated Preacher Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-seated-preacher-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-seated-preacher-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-seated-preacher-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-seated-preacher-curl.jpg',array['Sit on the preacher bench and plant your feet flat on the floor.','Hold a dumbbell with your palm facing up and place the back of your upper arm firmly against the pad.','Start with your arm nearly straight and let the dumbbell hang just above the bottom of the pad.','Curl the dumbbell upward by bending your elbow while keeping your upper arm pressed into the pad.','Lift until the dumbbell nears your shoulder and briefly squeeze your biceps.','Lower the dumbbell slowly until your arm is nearly straight again, then repeat before switching sides.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,true,array['single-arm preacher curl','seated preacher dumbbell curl','DB preacher curl','one-arm biceps curl on preacher bench','supported preacher curl','dumbbell seated preacher curl']::text[],'A seated single-arm biceps curl done against a preacher pad to isolate the elbow flexors and limit body momentum.',array['Upper arm lifting off the pad during the curl','Swinging the dumbbell instead of moving smoothly','Stopping short and not lowering near full extension','Bending the wrist back as the dumbbell rises']::text[],array['Keep upper arm glued down','Curl only at the elbow','Lower with control','Squeeze at the top']::text[],'Exhale as you curl the dumbbell up, and inhale as you lower it back down under control.',4.5),
('2188','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Seated Triceps Extension',array['triceps','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-seated-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-seated-triceps-extension.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-seated-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-seated-triceps-extension.jpg',array['Sit tall on a bench with both feet flat on the floor.','Hold one dumbbell by the top end with both hands and press it straight overhead.','Keep your upper arms close to your head and brace your torso.','Bend your elbows to lower the dumbbell behind your head under control.','Stop when your forearms are below parallel and your elbows stay pointed up.','Straighten your elbows to raise the dumbbell back to the overhead start position.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['seated dumbbell triceps extension','overhead dumbbell triceps extension','seated overhead triceps extension','two-hand dumbbell triceps extension','seated overhead dumbbell extension','seated triceps press','dumbbell seated triceps extension']::text[],'A seated overhead dumbbell triceps exercise where you lower the weight behind your head and extend your elbows to press it back up.',array['Elbows flare wide out to the sides.','Lower back arches as the weight goes overhead.','Upper arms drift backward and forward during the rep.','The dumbbell drops too low with no control behind the head.']::text[],array['Elbows point up','Keep biceps by ears','Move only at elbows','Brace your ribs down']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the dumbbell behind your head, and exhale as you extend your elbows to raise it overhead.',4.5),
('0406','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Shrug',array['traps','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-shrug.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-shrug.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-shrug.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-shrug.jpg',array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides and your feet about hip-width apart.','Let your arms hang straight with your palms facing your body.','Lift your shoulders straight up toward your ears without bending your elbows.','Pause briefly at the top while keeping your torso still.','Lower your shoulders back down under control to the start position and repeat.']::text[],'back','beginner',false,false,array['DB shrug','dumbbell shoulder shrug','trap shrug','dumbbell trap raise','shoulder lift with dumbbells','dumbbell shrug']::text[],'An isolation exercise where you hold dumbbells at your sides and lift your shoulders up to train the trapezius muscles.',array['Rolling the shoulders in circles instead of lifting straight up and down.','Bending the elbows and turning the move into an upright row.','Leaning the torso back or forward to swing the dumbbells.','Jutting the head forward as the shoulders rise.']::text[],array['Shoulders straight up','Arms stay long','Neck relaxed','Control the lowering']::text[],'Exhale as you shrug your shoulders up, and inhale as you lower them back down.',4.5),
('0407','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Side Bend',array['abs','obliques']::text[],array['obliques']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-side-bend.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-side-bend.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-side-bend.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-side-bend.jpg',array['Stand tall with your feet about hip-width apart and hold a dumbbell in one hand at your side.','Place your other hand on your hip or behind your head and brace your stomach.','Keep your chest up and slowly bend your torso sideways away from the dumbbell.','Lower the dumbbell down the side of your leg as far as you can without twisting or leaning forward.','Squeeze your obliques and return to standing tall.','Complete all reps on one side, then switch hands and repeat.']::text[],'waist','beginner',false,true,array['side bend','dumbbell oblique side bend','one-arm dumbbell side bend','standing dumbbell side bend','weighted side bend','dumbbell side bend']::text[],'A standing oblique exercise where you hold one dumbbell and bend your torso sideways under control.',array['Twisting the torso as you bend','Leaning forward instead of sideways','Shrugging the weighted shoulder up','Using momentum to swing back up']::text[],array['Bend only to the side','Keep chest tall','Brace your core','Move slowly and controlled']::text[],'Inhale as you bend sideways, then exhale as you return to standing.',4.5),
('0409','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Single Leg Calf Raise',array['calves','ankles']::text[],array['ankles']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-single-leg-calf-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-single-leg-calf-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-single-leg-calf-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-single-leg-calf-raise.jpg',array['Stand on the edge of a step with one foot, placing the ball of your foot on the step and letting your heel hang off.','Hold a dumbbell in one hand and lightly brace your other hand on a wall or rail.','Lift your nonworking foot off the step and straighten your standing leg.','Press through the ball of your foot to raise your heel as high as you can.','Pause briefly at the top while keeping your ankle stacked over your toes.','Lower your heel slowly below the step until you feel a stretch in your calf.','Complete all reps on one side, then switch legs.']::text[],'lower legs','beginner',false,true,array['single-leg dumbbell calf raise','one-leg calf raise','single leg calf raise','dumbbell calf raise','standing single-leg calf raise','one-leg heel raise','dumbbell single leg calf raise']::text[],'A single-leg calf exercise using a dumbbell and step to strengthen the calves through a full ankle range of motion.',array['Bouncing out of the bottom instead of lowering under control','Rolling the ankle inward or outward during the raise','Bending the standing knee to help drive up','Using the support hand to pull the body upward']::text[],array['Push through your big toe','Rise straight up','Lower with control','Keep hips level']::text[],'Inhale as you lower your heel, and exhale as you press up onto your toes.',4.5),
('0411','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Single Leg Squat',array['glutes','quadriceps']::text[],array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-single-leg-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-single-leg-squat.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-single-leg-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-single-leg-squat.jpg',array['Stand tall holding a dumbbell in each hand at your sides.','Shift your weight onto one foot and lift the other leg straight in front of you.','Brace your torso and bend your standing knee and hip to lower under control.','Keep the lifted leg off the floor and lower as far as you can while staying balanced.','Drive through the standing foot to rise back to the starting position.','Complete all reps on one leg, then switch sides.']::text[],'upper legs','advanced',true,true,array['single-leg dumbbell squat','dumbbell pistol squat','single leg squat with dumbbells','one-leg dumbbell squat','single-leg squat','one-leg squat','dumbbell single leg squat']::text[],'A one-leg squat holding dumbbells that challenges the glutes, quads, balance, and lower-body control.',array['Letting the lifted foot touch the floor between reps','Rounding the back at the bottom','Standing knee collapsing inward','Dropping too fast and losing balance']::text[],array['Chest up','Sit back','Keep knee tracking forward','Control the descent']::text[],'Inhale as you lower down, and exhale as you drive back up to standing.',6.0),
('0413','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Squat',array['glutes','quadriceps']::text[],array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-squat.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-squat.jpg',array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand at your sides and place your feet about shoulder-width apart.','Brace your core, keep your chest up, and let your arms hang straight.','Bend your hips and knees together to sit down and slightly back.','Lower until your thighs are at least parallel to the floor or as low as you can while keeping your heels down.','Drive through your midfoot and heels to stand back up.','Finish tall with your hips and knees fully straight before the next rep.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',true,false,array['DB squat','dumbbell goblet-free squat','dumbbells-at-sides squat','dumbbell body squat','squat with dumbbells','dumbbell squat']::text[],'A squat holding a dumbbell in each hand at your sides to train the glutes, quads, and legs.',array['Letting the knees cave inward on the way down or up.','Rising onto the toes and lifting the heels off the floor.','Rounding the upper or lower back at the bottom.','Dropping the chest forward so the dumbbells swing ahead of the legs.']::text[],array['Chest up','Knees track over toes','Keep heels down','Stand tall at top']::text[],'Inhale as you lower into the squat, then exhale as you stand back up.',6.0),
('0417','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Standing Calf Raise',array['calves','ankles']::text[],array['ankles']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-standing-calf-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-standing-calf-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-standing-calf-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-standing-calf-raise.jpg',array['Stand upright with a dumbbell in each hand and place your feet about hip-width apart.','Let your arms hang by your sides and keep your knees softly bent.','Press through the balls of your feet and lift your heels as high as you can.','Pause briefly at the top while staying tall through your torso.','Lower your heels back to the floor with control and repeat.']::text[],'lower legs','beginner',false,false,array['standing dumbbell calf raise','DB calf raise','dumbbell calf raises','standing calf raise','calf raises holding dumbbells','dumbbell standing calf raise']::text[],'A standing calf exercise where you hold dumbbells at your sides and raise your heels to train the calves and ankles.',array['Bouncing at the bottom instead of lowering under control','Rolling the ankles outward or inward','Bending the knees to turn it into a squat','Leaning the torso forward as the heels lift']::text[],array['Rise straight up','Press through big toe','Control the lowering','Keep torso tall']::text[],'Inhale as you lower your heels, and exhale as you press up onto your toes.',4.5),
('0432','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Stiff Leg Deadlift',array['glutes','hamstrings']::text[],array['hamstrings','lower back']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-stiff-leg-deadlift.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-stiff-leg-deadlift.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-stiff-leg-deadlift.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-stiff-leg-deadlift.jpg',array['Stand tall with your feet hip-width apart, holding a dumbbell in each hand in front of your thighs.','Soften your knees slightly and brace your midsection.','Push your hips straight back and slide the dumbbells down the front of your legs.','Lower until the dumbbells reach mid-shin or you feel a strong hamstring stretch while keeping your back flat.','Drive your feet into the floor and extend your hips to stand back up.','Finish tall with the dumbbells at your thighs and repeat.']::text[],'upper legs','intermediate',true,false,array['stiff leg deadlift','dumbbell SLDL','dumbbell stiff-legged deadlift','straight-leg dumbbell deadlift','dumbbell hamstring deadlift','dumbbell stiff leg deadlift']::text[],'A hip-hinge deadlift with dumbbells that emphasizes the hamstrings and glutes while keeping only a slight knee bend.',array['Bending the knees too much and turning it into a squat','Letting the dumbbells drift away from the legs','Rounding the lower back on the way down','Looking up and cranking the neck']::text[],array['Hips back, not down','Keep dumbbells close','Back flat the whole time','Feel the hamstring stretch']::text[],'Inhale as you hinge and lower the dumbbells, then exhale as you drive your hips forward to stand tall.',6.0),
('new-dumbbell-sumo-squat','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Sumo Squat',array['glutes','gluteus maximus']::text[],array['quadriceps','adductors','hamstrings']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-bar-grip-sumo-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-bar-grip-sumo-squat.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/dumbbell-bar-grip-sumo-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/dumbbell-bar-grip-sumo-squat.jpg',array['Stand with feet wide apart, toes angled outward.','Grip the dumbbell vertically between your legs.','Keep chest up and core braced.','Squat down, pushing knees outward.','Drive through heels to stand up.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',true,false,array['dumbbell sumo squat','sumo squat dumbbell','bar grip sumo squat','Dumbbell Bar Grip Sumo Squat']::text[],'A lower body exercise using a dumbbell in a sumo stance to target the glutes, quads, and adductors.',array['Letting knees cave in','Rounding the back','Shallow squats']::text[],array['Knees out','Keep chest tall','Sit hips back','Drive through heels']::text[],'Inhale as you lower down, exhale as you stand up.',6.0),
('0437','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dumbbell Upright Row',array['delts','traps']::text[],array['traps','biceps']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/dumbbell-upright-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/dumbbell-upright-row.jpg',null,null,array['Stand tall with a dumbbell in each hand in front of your thighs, palms facing your body.','Brace your midsection and keep your chest lifted.','Pull the dumbbells straight up along the front of your body by driving your elbows up and out.','Raise until the dumbbells reach about upper-chest height and your elbows stay higher than your hands.','Pause briefly, then lower the dumbbells back to your thighs with control.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',true,false,array['upright row','dumbbell high pull','DB upright row','standing dumbbell upright row','dumbbell row to chin','dumbbell upright row']::text[],'A standing shoulder and upper-trap exercise where you pull dumbbells up the front of your body with elbows leading.',array['Pulling the dumbbells all the way to the chin','Letting the wrists bend sharply at the top','Swinging the torso to start the lift','Hands rising higher than the elbows']::text[],array['Lead with your elbows','Keep dumbbells close','Shoulders down and back','Lift to upper chest']::text[],'Exhale as you pull the dumbbells up, and inhale as you lower them back down.',6.0),
('1167','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Dynamic Chest Stretch',array['pectorals','pectoralis major']::text[],array['anterior deltoids','biceps']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-dynamic-chest-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-dynamic-chest-stretch.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/stretching-dynamic-chest-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/stretching-dynamic-chest-stretch.jpg',array['Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart.','Extend both arms out to your sides at shoulder height.','Swing your arms forward, crossing them in front of your chest.','Open your arms wide, stretching your chest as you do.','Repeat the swinging motion for the desired number of repetitions.']::text[],'chest','beginner',false,false,array['dynamic chest opener','arm swings chest','chest warm-up swing','Stretching - Dynamic Chest Stretch','dynamic chest stretch']::text[],'A rhythmic arm movement to increase chest mobility and warm up the pectoral muscles.',array['Swinging arms too forcefully','Allowing shoulders to shrug','Rotating the torso excessively']::text[],array['Keep movements controlled','Maintain upright posture','Engage core','Avoid twisting torso']::text[],'Breathe naturally throughout the movement.',3.8),
('2141','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Elliptical Trainer',array['cardiovascular system']::text[],array['quadriceps','hamstrings','gluteus maximus','calves','pectoralis major','deltoids']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/elliptical.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/elliptical.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/elliptical.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/elliptical.jpg',array['Step onto the pedals and hold the handles.','Select desired resistance and incline.','Begin moving feet in a smooth, elliptical pattern.','Push and pull the handles with your arms in sync with your strides.','Maintain a steady cadence and upright posture.']::text[],'cardio','beginner',true,false,array['elliptical','cross trainer','elliptical machine','walk elliptical cross trainer']::text[],'A low-impact cardio exercise using a standing elliptical machine for total body endurance and aerobic gains.',array['Leaning too far forward or backward','Relying only on legs or arms','Choppy, fast movements']::text[],array['Keep chest up','Balance weight evenly','Smooth, controlled motion','Engage core lightly']::text[],'Maintain rhythmic, deep breathing throughout the workout.',8.0),
('1338','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Exercise Ball Sit-Up',array['abdominals','rectus abdominis']::text[],array['hip flexors','obliques']::text[],'stability ball','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/sit-up-on-exercise-ball.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/sit-up-on-exercise-ball.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/sit-up-on-exercise-ball.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/sit-up-on-exercise-ball.jpg',array['Sit on the exercise ball with feet flat on the floor.','Walk feet forward, rolling until the ball supports your lower back.','Cross arms over your chest or position hands behind your head.','Engage your core and sit up, lifting your upper body.','Lower back down under control to starting position.']::text[],'waist','beginner',false,false,array['stability ball sit-up','Swiss ball sit-up','ball crunch','Sit-up On Exercise Ball','exercise ball hug']::text[],'A core exercise where sit-ups are performed while stabilizing on a Swiss ball, increasing abdominal activation.',array['Using momentum','Feet lifting off the ground','Ball not positioned under lower back']::text[],array['Keep feet planted','Avoid pulling neck','Engage abs throughout','Do not arch lower back']::text[],'Exhale as you lift, inhale as you lower.',4.5),
