('drv-stretching-feet-and-ankles-stretch','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Feet and Ankles Stretch',array['calves','gastrocnemius, soleus']::text[],array['tibialis anterior','peroneals']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-feet-and-ankles-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-feet-and-ankles-stretch.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/stretching-feet-and-ankles-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/stretching-feet-and-ankles-stretch.jpg',array['Sit or stand with legs extended or positioned comfortably.','Point your toes downward to stretch the top of your feet and fronts of your ankles.','Flex your toes upward toward your shins to stretch the calves and back of the ankles.','Hold each position for 15-30 seconds.','Repeat the sequence for several reps.']::text[],'lower legs','beginner',false,false,array['ankle stretch','foot stretch','ankle mobility stretch']::text[],'A stretch to increase flexibility and mobility in the feet and ankle muscles.',array['Bouncing during the stretch','Overstretching or forcing range of motion','Holding breath']::text[],array['Move slowly through each phase','Hold gentle tension, do not force','Keep knees extended but soft','Breathe evenly']::text[],'Breathe normally throughout, or exhale as you relax into each stretch.',3.8),
