('0257','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Hip Circles Stretch',array['hip flexors','iliopsoas, gluteus medius, gluteus minimus']::text[],array['tensor fasciae latae','gluteus maximus','adductors','piriformis']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-hip-circles-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-hip-circles-stretch.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/stretching-hip-circles-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/stretching-hip-circles-stretch.jpg',array['Stand tall with feet shoulder-width apart, hands on hips.','Lift one knee up in front of you.','Move your knee and thigh in a circular motion outward.','Reverse and perform circles inward after the set.','Switch legs and repeat.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',false,false,array['hip mobility circles','hip joint circles','dynamic hip stretch','hip rotations','Stretching - Hip Circles Stretch','circles knee stretch']::text[],'A dynamic stretch to increase mobility in the hips by performing circular leg movements.',array['Rushing the circles','Swinging the whole body','Holding breath']::text[],array['Move leg from the hip','Keep upper body stable','Smooth, controlled circles','Breathe steadily']::text[],'Inhale and exhale naturally during the stretch.',3.8),
