('drv-jackknife-pilates','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Jackknife',array['rectus abdominis']::text[],array['hip flexors','lower back','glutes']::text[],'body weight',null,null,'https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/jackknife-pilates.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/jackknife-pilates.jpg',array['Lie on your back with arms at your sides and legs extended.','Engage your core and lift legs towards the ceiling.','Continue lifting hips off the mat, reaching feet upward.','Pause at the top with hips elevated.','Slowly roll back down vertebra by vertebra.']::text[],'waist','intermediate',true,false,array['jackknife pilates','pilates jackknife','reverse rollover','jackknife exercise']::text[],'A Pilates core exercise involving lifting hips and legs up and overhead to strengthen the abdominals.',array['Letting legs fall too quickly','Arching the back excessively','Pushing with arms']::text[],array['Keep legs straight','Lift with core','Control the descent','Avoid swinging']::text[],'Exhale while lifting up, inhale while lowering down.',5.0),
