('drv-stretching-kneeling-back-rotation-stretch','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Kneeling Back Rotation Stretch',array['thoracic spine','thoracic spinal extensors']::text[],array['obliques','pectorals','latissimus dorsi']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-kneeling-back-rotation-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-kneeling-back-rotation-stretch.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/stretching-kneeling-back-rotation-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/stretching-kneeling-back-rotation-stretch.jpg',array['Kneel on the floor (all fours or lunge position).','Place one hand behind your head or neck.','Rotate elbow and upper body upward, opening chest.','Hold for a moment at top of rotation.','Return to start and repeat; switch sides.']::text[],'chest','beginner',false,true,array['kneeling thoracic rotation stretch','kneeling spinal rotation']::text[],'A mobility stretch that improves thoracic spine rotation while kneeling, also opening the chest and shoulders.',array['Rotating through lower back','Forcing the stretch','Letting hips move']::text[],array['Keep hips stable','Open chest fully','Rotate through upper back','Move slowly']::text[],'Exhale as you rotate, inhale returning to start.',3.8),
('1346','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Kneeling Lat Stretch',array['lats','latissimus dorsi']::text[],array['teres major','triceps brachii','erector spinae']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-kneeling-lat-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-kneeling-lat-stretch.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/stretching-kneeling-lat-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/stretching-kneeling-lat-stretch.jpg',array['Kneel and sit hips back on heels.','Reach both arms forward, palms on floor.','Push chest toward the ground.','Hold the stretch, focusing on the long side body.','Optionally shift hands to each side for more stretch.']::text[],'back','beginner',false,false,array['kneeling latissimus stretch','kneeling child''s pose lat stretch','Stretching - Kneeling Lat Stretch','kneeling lat stretch']::text[],'A floor stretch to lengthen the latissimus dorsi and improve shoulder mobility.',array['Arching lower back excessively','Bending elbows too much','Letting hips lift off heels','Tensing shoulders']::text[],array['Keep arms straight','Reach fingertips forward','Drop chest down','Relax neck and shoulders']::text[],'Inhale deeply as you reach forward, exhale as you sink deeper into the stretch.',3.8),
('1771','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Kneeling Triceps Stretch',array['triceps','triceps brachii']::text[],array['latissimus dorsi','deltoids']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-kneeling-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-kneeling-triceps-extension.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/stretching-kneeling-triceps-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/stretching-kneeling-triceps-extension.jpg',array['Kneel on the floor or mat.','Raise one arm overhead then bend the elbow so your hand touches your upper back.','Use your other hand to gently push on the bent elbow.','Hold the stretch.','Switch arms and repeat.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['kneeling triceps extension stretch','overhead triceps stretch','kneeling arm stretch','Stretching - Kneeling Triceps Extension','bodyweight kneeling triceps extension']::text[],'A static stretch targeting the triceps and lats by flexing the elbow overhead while kneeling.',array['Arching the back','Pushing too hard','Letting elbow flare out']::text[],array['Keep back straight','Elbow points up','Gently press, don’t force','Relax neck and shoulders']::text[],'Breathe deeply and steadily throughout the stretch.',3.8),
('0562','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Landmine 180',array['abs','obliques']::text[],array['obliques','quadriceps']::text[],'barbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/landmine-180.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/landmine-180.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/landmine-180.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/landmine-180.jpg',array['Stand facing the free end of the barbell with your feet about shoulder-width apart, and hold the barbell sleeve with both hands in front of your chest.','Bend your knees slightly, brace your midsection, and keep your arms long but not locked.','Rotate your shoulders and hips together to lower the barbell toward one hip.','Drive through your feet and rotate across your body to sweep the barbell in an arc toward the opposite side.','Control the barbell as it changes direction, and continue rotating side to side with your chest facing the barbell.','Keep the movement smooth and balanced on both sides until the set is complete.']::text[],'waist','intermediate',true,false,array['landmine 180','landmine rotation','barbell 180','landmine twists','barbell side-to-side rotation']::text[],'A rotating landmine core exercise where you swing the barbell side to side using your hips, shoulders, and obliques.',array['Twisting only the arms while the torso stays still','Letting the lower back arch as the bar moves','Locking the knees and staying flat-footed','Jerking the bar instead of controlling the arc']::text[],array['Rotate hips and shoulders together','Brace your core','Move the bar in an arc','Stay tall through the chest']::text[],'Inhale as the barbell moves to one side, and exhale as you rotate it across to the other side.',6.0),
('0600','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Leg Raise Crunch',array['rectus abdominis']::text[],array['hip flexors','obliques']::text[],'body weight',null,null,'https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/crunch-leg-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/crunch-leg-raise.jpg',array['Lie on your back and extend your legs.','Place your hands by your sides or behind your head.','Simultaneously lift your legs and upper torso toward each other.','Squeeze at the top of the movement.','Lower your legs and upper body back down under control.']::text[],'waist','beginner',false,false,array['crunch with leg raise','reverse crunch','lying leg raise crunch','leg lift crunch','Crunch (leg raise)','lever seated leg raise crunch']::text[],'An ab exercise combining a crunch with a leg raise to emphasize upper and lower abdominals.',array['Arching the lower back','Using momentum','Neck strain from pulling']::text[],array['Keep lower back pressed to floor','Move slowly','Exhale at the crunch','Don''t use momentum']::text[],'Exhale during the crunch, inhale as you return.',3.8),
('drv-leg-raise-hip-lift','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Leg Raise with Hip Lift',array['rectus abdominis']::text[],array['hip flexors','lower back']::text[],'body weight',null,null,'https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/leg-raise-hip-lift.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/leg-raise-hip-lift.jpg',array['Lie flat with arms at your sides and legs straight.','Raise your legs up together towards the ceiling.','At the top of the movement, press your legs up by lifting your hips off the ground.','Pause, squeezing your abs.','Lower your hips and legs back to the starting position slowly.']::text[],'waist','intermediate',false,false,array['leg raise hip thrust','lying leg raise with hip lift','hip lift leg raise']::text[],'A core exercise combining a leg raise with a hip lift to target the lower abdominals.',array['Using momentum','Arching lower back','Not controlling the descent']::text[],array['Keep legs together','Don’t swing','Lift hips with control','Keep back flat']::text[],'Exhale during hip lift, inhale during the descent.',3.8),
('0573','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Back Extension',array['spine','glutes']::text[],array['glutes','hamstrings']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-back-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-back-extension.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-back-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-back-extension.jpg',array['Adjust the machine so the back pad sits comfortably against your upper back and your feet are secured on the platform.','Sit tall against the pad and grip the handles or side bars.','Brace your core and lean your torso forward under control through the machine''s range.','Stop at the bottom when you feel a comfortable stretch and keep your feet pressed into the platform.','Drive your torso back against the pad until you return to an upright position.','Repeat smoothly without bouncing or jerking the pad.']::text[],'back','beginner',true,false,array['machine back extension','lever back extension','back extension machine','seated back extension','lower back machine extension']::text[],'A machine-based trunk extension that trains the lower back, glutes, and hamstrings by moving your torso against resistance.',array['Using momentum and bouncing out of the bottom position','Pushing through a short, rushed range of motion','Letting the feet lift or shift on the platform','Hyperextending far past upright at the top']::text[],array['Brace before you move','Move through a smooth arc','Keep feet firmly planted','Return to tall posture']::text[],'Inhale as you lean forward, then exhale as you extend back to an upright position.',6.0),
