('0585','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Leg Extension',array['quads','hamstrings']::text[],array['hamstrings']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-leg-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-leg-extension.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-leg-extension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-leg-extension.jpg',array['Adjust the seat and backrest so your knees line up with the machine''s pivot point.','Sit back against the pad and place your shins behind the lower roller pad.','Grip the handles and start with your knees bent and feet pointed forward.','Straighten your knees to lift the pad until your legs are nearly straight.','Pause briefly while keeping your thighs pressed into the seat.','Lower the pad with control until your knees are bent again.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',false,false,array['leg extension','machine leg extension','lever leg extension','quad extension','seated leg extension','leg straighten machine']::text[],'A seated machine exercise that strengthens the quadriceps by extending the knees against a padded lever.',array['Knees sit too far forward or behind the machine pivot.','Swinging the weight up with momentum.','Locking the knees hard at the top.','Lifting the hips or lower back off the seat.']::text[],array['Line up knees with pivot','Lift with your quads','Keep hips on the seat','Lower under control']::text[],'Exhale as you straighten your knees, and inhale as you lower the pad back down.',4.5),
('0577','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Lying Chest Press',array['pectorals','pectoralis major']::text[],array['triceps brachii','anterior deltoids']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-lying-chest-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-lying-chest-press.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-lying-chest-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-lying-chest-press.jpg',array['Lie supine on the machine bench.','Grip the handles firmly, elbows bent.','Engage chest and press handles forward and up.','Fully extend arms without locking out elbows.','Slowly return to starting position.']::text[],'chest','beginner',true,false,array['machine bench press','hammer strength chest press','plate-loaded chest press','Lever Lying Chest Press','lever chest press']::text[],'A plate-loaded machine press mimicking the bench press to target the entire chest safely.',array['Letting shoulders roll forward','Lifting lower back off bench','Using too much weight','Allowing wrists to bend']::text[],array['Keep feet flat on floor','Don''t overextend elbows','Press evenly with both arms','Squeeze chest at top']::text[],'Exhale as you press up, inhale as you lower down.',6.0),
('0586','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Lying Leg Curl',array['hamstrings','calves']::text[],array['calves']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-lying-leg-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-lying-leg-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-lying-leg-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-lying-leg-curl.jpg',array['Adjust the machine so your knees line up with the machine''s pivot and the pad rests against the back of your lower legs above your heels.','Lie face down on the bench with your legs straight and grab the handles or bench edges for support.','Press your hips into the pad and point your toes forward to set your start position.','Curl the pad upward by bending your knees until your heels move toward your glutes.','Pause briefly at the top while keeping your hips down and thighs on the pad.','Lower the pad back down under control until your legs are straight again.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',false,false,array['lying leg curl','machine lying leg curl','prone leg curl','hamstring curl machine','leg curl machine','lever lying leg curl']::text[],'A machine hamstring exercise done face down by bending the knees to curl a padded lever toward the glutes.',array['Lifting the hips off the pad at the top','Using momentum to swing the pad upward','Stopping short and not fully lowering the pad','Feet turning sharply inward or outward during the curl']::text[],array['Keep hips glued down','Curl through the hamstrings','Move slow on the way down','Knees stay in line']::text[],'Exhale as you curl the pad up, and inhale as you lower it back down under control.',4.5),
('0592','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Preacher Curl',array['biceps','forearms']::text[],array['forearms']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-preacher-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-preacher-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-preacher-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-preacher-curl.jpg',array['Adjust the seat so your armpits sit close to the top of the preacher pad.','Sit down and place the backs of your upper arms flat on the pad.','Grip the machine handles with an underhand grip and straighten your arms to the start.','Keep your chest up and curl the handles toward your shoulders by bending your elbows.','Squeeze your biceps briefly at the top without lifting your upper arms off the pad.','Lower the handles under control until your arms are nearly straight again.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',false,false,array['preacher curl machine','machine preacher curl','lever biceps curl','preacher arm curl','biceps curl machine','lever preacher curl']::text[],'A machine biceps curl done with the upper arms braced on a preacher pad to isolate elbow flexion.',array['Upper arms lifting off the pad as the handles rise','Using the shoulders or rocking the torso to start the curl','Letting the weight drop quickly on the way down','Bending the wrists back instead of keeping them straight']::text[],array['Keep upper arms glued down','Curl only at the elbows','Lift smooth, lower slower','Keep wrists neutral']::text[],'Exhale as you curl the handles up, and inhale as you lower them back down under control.',4.5),
('0593','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Reverse Hyperextension',array['glutes','hamstrings']::text[],array['hamstrings','lower back']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-reverse-hyperextension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-reverse-hyperextension.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-reverse-hyperextension.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-reverse-hyperextension.jpg',array['Adjust the machine so your hips rest on the pad and your legs can hang freely.','Lie face down with your torso supported and grip the handles or sides for stability.','Place your feet against the foot pads and let your legs hang down under control.','Brace your midsection and squeeze your glutes to raise your legs behind you.','Lift until your legs are about in line with your torso without arching your lower back.','Lower your legs slowly to the start position and repeat.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',true,false,array['reverse hyperextension machine','lever reverse hyper','machine reverse hyperextension','reverse leg raise machine','glute raise on machine','lever reverse hyperextension']::text[],'A machine glute and hamstring exercise where you raise your legs behind you while lying face down on a pad.',array['Swinging the legs up with momentum','Arching the lower back at the top','Letting the hips slide off the pad','Bending and straightening the knees during each rep']::text[],array['Lift with your glutes','Keep hips on the pad','Control the swing','Stop at torso level']::text[],'Inhale as you lower your legs, and exhale as you raise them behind you.',6.0),
('1349','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Reverse T-Bar Row',array['upper back','biceps']::text[],array['biceps','forearms']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-reverse-t-bar-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-reverse-t-bar-row.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-reverse-t-bar-row.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-reverse-t-bar-row.jpg',array['Adjust the seat or chest pad so the handles line up around mid-chest when you reach forward.','Place your chest firmly against the pad and set your feet flat on the platform.','Grab the handles with an overhand grip and straighten your arms without rounding your shoulders.','Pull the handles toward your chest by driving your elbows back and out slightly.','Squeeze your shoulder blades together at the end of the pull.','Lower the handles under control until your arms are straight again.']::text[],'back','beginner',true,false,array['reverse T-bar row machine','chest-supported reverse row','lever chest-supported row','machine upper back row','pronated grip machine row','lever reverse t-bar row']::text[],'A chest-supported leverage machine row using an overhand grip to train the upper back, biceps, and forearms.',array['Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears','Bouncing the chest off the pad to move the handles','Letting the upper back round at the start','Yanking the weight and dropping it back fast']::text[],array['Chest stays on pad','Lead with your elbows','Squeeze shoulder blades together','Control the lowering']::text[],'Exhale as you pull the handles toward your chest, and inhale as you lower them back under control.',6.0),
('0594','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Seated Calf Raise',array['calves','soleus']::text[],array['soleus','ankle stabilizers']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-seated-calf-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-seated-calf-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-seated-calf-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-seated-calf-raise.jpg',array['Adjust the seat so the thigh pad rests securely on your thighs with your knees bent about 90 degrees.','Place the balls of your feet on the footplate with your heels hanging off the edge.','Grip the handles or seat and lift your heels to take the weight onto your calves.','Press through the balls of your feet to raise your heels as high as you can.','Pause briefly at the top while keeping your toes planted.','Lower your heels slowly until you feel a stretch in your calves, then repeat.']::text[],'lower legs','beginner',false,false,array['seated calf raise machine','machine seated calf raise','lever calf raise','seated calf raise','calf raise seated machine','seated heel raise','lever seated calf raise']::text[],'A seated machine calf exercise where you raise and lower your heels to train the soleus through ankle plantarflexion.',array['Bouncing out of the bottom instead of lowering under control.','Letting the knees shift up and down during the rep.','Rolling the feet outward or inward on the platform.','Using only a short top-half range of motion.']::text[],array['Drive through big toe','Lift heels straight up','Control the lowering','Keep knees still']::text[],'Inhale as you lower your heels, and exhale as you press up onto the balls of your feet.',4.5),
('1452','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Seated Crunch',array['rectus abdominis']::text[],array['obliques','hip flexors']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-seated-crunch-1.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-seated-crunch-1.jpg',null,null,array['Adjust seat and select appropriate resistance.','Sit back and secure feet and handles as designed.','Engage abs and flex spine forward in a crunch motion.','Bring chest toward knees while exhaling.','Control return to start and repeat.']::text[],'waist','beginner',false,false,array['machine crunch','ab crunch machine','seated ab crunch','Lever Seated Crunch (1)','lever seated crunch']::text[],'A machine exercise that isolates and strengthens the abdominal muscles through spinal flexion.',array['Letting hip flexors dominate','Using excessive weight','Rushing reps','Partial range of motion']::text[],array['Move with abs, not hips','Don''t use momentum','Controlled movement','Full range of motion']::text[],'Exhale as you crunch down, inhale as you return up.',4.5),
('1451','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Seated Dip',array['triceps','triceps brachii']::text[],array['pectorals','anterior deltoids']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-seated-dips.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-seated-dips.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-seated-dips.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-seated-dips.jpg',array['Adjust the seat and select appropriate weight.','Sit down and grip the handles firmly.','Press the handles downward by extending your arms fully.','Pause briefly at lockout.','Return to the start position slowly.']::text[],'upper arms','beginner',true,false,array['machine triceps dip','seated dip machine','leverage dip machine','triceps machine dips','Lever Seated Dips','lever seated dip']::text[],'A machine-based dip that targets the triceps, chest, and shoulders in a seated position.',array['Allowing elbows to flare out','Using excessive weight','Swinging or jerking movement']::text[],array['Keep elbows close','Control the descent','Do not lock elbows','Sit upright']::text[],'Exhale on pressing down, inhale on returning up.',6.0),
('0597','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Seated Hip Abduction',array['abductors','glutes']::text[],array['glutes','hamstrings']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-seated-hip-abduction.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-seated-hip-abduction.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-seated-hip-abduction.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-seated-hip-abduction.jpg',array['Adjust the seat so your knees bend about 90 degrees and the thigh pads rest against the outside of your legs.','Sit tall with your back against the pad, place your feet on the footrests, and grip the handles.','Start with your legs together and your knees aligned with the machine''s pivot.','Drive your knees outward against the pads until your legs are as wide as your comfortable range allows.','Pause briefly with your hips still on the seat.','Bring your legs back together slowly until the pads nearly touch, then repeat.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',false,false,array['seated hip abduction','hip abductor machine','abductor machine','machine hip abduction','outer thigh machine','lever seated hip abduction']::text[],'A seated machine exercise where you press your legs outward against pads to train the hip abductors and outer glutes.',array['Leaning the torso forward or rocking back to move the weight.','Letting the legs snap back together on the return.','Lifting the hips off the seat at the widest point.','Turning the feet excessively to cheat the movement.']::text[],array['Sit tall','Drive knees out','Control the return','Keep hips on seat']::text[],'Exhale as you press your knees outward, and inhale as you return to the starting position.',4.5),
('0598','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Seated Hip Adduction',array['adductors','hamstrings']::text[],array['hamstrings','glutes']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-seated-hip-adduction.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-seated-hip-adduction.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-seated-hip-adduction.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-seated-hip-adduction.jpg',array['Adjust the seat and pads so your knees line up with the machine''s pivot point.','Sit tall with your back against the pad, place your legs outside the thigh pads, and grab the handles.','Set your feet flat on the footrests and start with your legs comfortably apart.','Bring your legs together by pressing inward against the pads.','Squeeze your inner thighs briefly when the pads come together.','Return the pads outward slowly until you reach the start position without letting the weight slam.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',false,false,array['seated hip adduction','hip adductor machine','inner thigh machine','seated inner thigh squeeze','machine hip adduction','lever seated hip adduction']::text[],'A seated machine exercise that trains the inner thighs by bringing the legs together against resistance.',array['Leaning forward or lifting the lower back off the pad.','Letting the pads fly open on the way back.','Using short, bouncing reps instead of controlled motion.','Turning the feet and knees excessively to force the movement.']::text[],array['Sit tall','Control both directions','Squeeze inner thighs','Keep hips still']::text[],'Exhale as you press your legs together, and inhale as you return to the starting position.',4.5),
('0599','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Seated Leg Curl',array['hamstrings','calves']::text[],array['calves']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-seated-leg-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-seated-leg-curl.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-seated-leg-curl.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-seated-leg-curl.jpg',array['Adjust the seat and pad so your knees line up with the machine’s pivot point.','Sit back against the pad and place your lower legs under the roller just above your ankles.','Grip the handles and keep your thighs pressed into the seat.','Curl the pad down by bending your knees until your heels move toward the floor.','Pause briefly and squeeze your hamstrings at the bottom.','Lower the pad back up with control until your knees are nearly straight.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',false,false,array['seated leg curl','machine seated leg curl','lever leg curl','seated hamstring curl','hamstring curl machine','leg curl machine','lever seated leg curl']::text[],'A seated machine hamstring exercise where you bend your knees to pull a padded lever downward.',array['Lifting the hips off the seat during the curl.','Using momentum and swinging the pad through the rep.','Letting the knees fully lock out at the top.','Setting the pad too high on the calves instead of above the ankles.']::text[],array['Keep hips glued down','Curl through the heels','Move only at knees','Lower with control']::text[],'Exhale as you curl the pad down, and inhale as you return it to the starting position.',4.5),
('0602','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Seated Reverse Fly',array['delts','trapezius']::text[],array['trapezius','rhomboids']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-seated-reverse-fly.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-seated-reverse-fly.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-seated-reverse-fly.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-seated-reverse-fly.jpg',array['Adjust the seat so the handles are about shoulder height when you sit down.','Sit with your chest against the pad, feet flat on the floor, and grasp the handles with an overhand grip.','Start with your arms in front of you and keep a soft bend in your elbows.','Pull the handles out and back in a wide arc until your upper arms line up with your shoulders.','Squeeze your rear shoulders and upper back at the end of the movement.','Return the handles slowly to the start without letting the weight slam down.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',false,false,array['seated reverse fly machine','machine rear delt fly','rear delt machine fly','reverse pec deck','seated rear shoulder fly','lever seated reverse fly']::text[],'A machine rear-delt exercise where you pull the handles out and back while seated with your chest supported.',array['Shrugging the shoulders up toward the ears','Straightening the elbows and turning it into a press','Letting the chest come off the pad','Swinging the handles back with momentum']::text[],array['Lead with your elbows','Keep chest on the pad','Soft bend in elbows','Squeeze shoulder blades together']::text[],'Exhale as you pull the handles back, and inhale as you return to the starting position.',4.5),
('0604','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Lever Shrug',array['traps','shoulders']::text[],array['shoulders']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/lever-shrug.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/lever-shrug.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/lever-shrug.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/lever-shrug.jpg',array['Adjust the machine so the handles rest at your sides with your shoulders relaxed.','Sit or stand against the pad and grasp the handles with a firm overhand grip.','Straighten your arms and set your chest tall with your neck neutral.','Lift your shoulders straight up toward your ears without bending your elbows.','Pause briefly at the top while keeping your torso still.','Lower your shoulders under control until they return to the start.']::text[],'back','beginner',false,false,array['machine shrug','lever machine shrug','shrug machine','trap shrug machine','shoulder shrug machine','lever shrug']::text[],'A machine trap exercise where you lift your shoulders straight up against the handles to train the upper trapezius.',array['Bending the elbows and turning it into a row','Rolling the shoulders forward or backward','Leaning the torso to move the weight','Jutting the chin forward as the shoulders rise']::text[],array['Shoulders straight up','Arms stay long','Keep chest tall','Control the lowering']::text[],'Inhale at the bottom, exhale as you shrug your shoulders up, then inhale as you lower back down.',4.5),
