('0738','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Sled 45 Degree Calf Press',array['calves','hamstrings']::text[],array['hamstrings']::text[],'sled machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/sled-45-degree-calf-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/sled-45-degree-calf-press.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/sled-45-degree-calf-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/sled-45-degree-calf-press.jpg',array['Sit in the 45-degree sled machine and place the balls of both feet on the lower edge of the platform with your heels hanging off.','Straighten your legs enough to support the sled and keep a small bend in your knees.','Let your heels drop down by bending at the ankles until you feel a stretch in your calves.','Press through the balls of your feet and raise your heels as high as you can.','Pause briefly at the top while keeping your legs steady.','Lower your heels under control back to the stretched position and repeat.']::text[],'lower legs','beginner',false,false,array['45 degree sled calf press','sled calf press','leg press calf raise','calf press on leg press','machine calf press','sled 45 degree calf press']::text[],'A seated calf exercise on a 45-degree sled where you press through the balls of your feet to raise and lower the heels.',array['Bending and straightening the knees instead of moving only at the ankles','Placing the whole foot flat on the platform so the heels cannot drop','Bouncing out of the bottom instead of lowering under control','Turning the toes excessively in or out during the rep']::text[],array['Drive through the balls of feet','Lift heels as high as possible','Control the heel drop','Keep knees softly bent']::text[],'Inhale as you lower your heels, and exhale as you press through the balls of your feet to raise them.',4.5),
('0740','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Sled 45 Degree Wide Leg Press',array['quadriceps','quadriceps femoris']::text[],array['gluteus maximus','adductors','hamstrings']::text[],'leverage machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/sled-45-degree-leg-wide-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/sled-45-degree-leg-wide-press.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/sled-45-degree-leg-wide-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/sled-45-degree-leg-wide-press.jpg',array['Adjust the seat and load desired weight.','Sit with your back and head against the pad, feet flat and wide on the platform.','Release the safety handles and grasp the side handles.','Bend your knees to lower the platform until your thighs reach 90 degrees or just past.','Press through your heels to extend your legs fully, but avoid locking out the knees.']::text[],'upper legs','intermediate',true,false,array['leg press machine','hack squat press','plate-loaded leg press','wide stance leg press','Sled 45 Degree Leg Wide Press','sled 45° leg wide press']::text[],'A compound lower body movement targeting the quadriceps with emphasis on glutes and adductors due to a wide foot stance.',array['Allowing knees to collapse inward','Rounding lower back','Half reps or short range','Locking knees at extension']::text[],array['Push through heels','Keep knees in line with toes','Do not lock knees at top','Maintain flat lower back']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the platform, exhale as you press it back up.',6.0),
('0743','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Sled Hack Squat',array['glutes','quadriceps']::text[],array['quadriceps','hamstrings','calves']::text[],'sled machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/sled-hack-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/sled-hack-squat.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/sled-hack-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/sled-hack-squat.jpg',array['Stand on the sled platform with your back against the pad and your shoulders under the pads.','Place your feet about shoulder-width apart on the platform with toes turned slightly out, then grip the handles.','Unlock the sled and lower yourself by bending your knees and hips until your thighs reach parallel or your deepest controlled position.','Keep your full foot planted against the platform as your knees track in line with your toes.','Drive through your heels and midfoot to extend your knees and hips and return the sled upward.','Stop just short of locking your knees, then continue into the next repetition.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',true,false,array['hack squat','sled hack squat machine','machine hack squat','hack squat machine','angled sled squat','supported sled squat','sled hack squat']::text[],'A machine squat on an angled sled with your back supported to train the quads, glutes, and legs through a controlled range.',array['Feet placed too low so the heels lift off the platform','Knees collapsing inward during the lowering phase','Lower back rounding or hips peeling off the pad','Bouncing out of the bottom instead of pausing briefly']::text[],array['Keep your back on pad','Knees track over toes','Push through whole foot','Control the descent']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the sled, then exhale as you press it back up.',6.0),
('0750','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Smith Chair Squat',array['quads','glutes']::text[],array['glutes','hamstrings','calves']::text[],'smith machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/smith-chair-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/smith-chair-squat.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/smith-chair-squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/smith-chair-squat.jpg',array['Set the Smith bar across your upper back and stand with your feet about shoulder-width apart, slightly in front of the bar path.','Unrack the bar and brace your core with your chest up and eyes forward.','Bend your knees and hips together to sit straight down under control.','Lower until your thighs are about parallel to the floor or slightly below while keeping your heels down.','Drive through your midfoot and heels to stand back up until your knees and hips are fully extended.','Lock out tall, then repeat for the next rep.']::text[],'upper legs','beginner',true,false,array['smith chair squat','smith machine squat','smith squat','machine back squat','guided bar squat']::text[],'A Smith machine squat variation that targets the quads while training the glutes and hamstrings through a controlled bar path.',array['Feet set directly under the bar so the knees travel too far forward.','Heels lift off the floor at the bottom.','Knees cave inward during the ascent.','Lower back rounds as the hips drop.']::text[],array['Chest up','Knees track over toes','Drive through heels','Brace your core']::text[],'Inhale and brace before you lower, then exhale as you drive back up to standing.',6.0),
('1393','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Smith Machine Calf Raise',array['calves','gastrocnemius']::text[],array['soleus']::text[],'smith machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/smith-calf-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/smith-calf-raise.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/smith-calf-raise.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/smith-calf-raise.jpg',array['Set up the Smith machine bar at shoulder height.','Step under the bar, position it across your upper traps, and unrack.','Stand upright with feet hip to shoulder-width apart.','Rise onto the balls of your feet by extending your ankles.','Pause at the top, then lower your heels in a controlled manner.']::text[],'lower legs','beginner',false,false,array['smith calf raise','smith standing calf raise','smith machine standing calf press','smith one leg floor calf raise']::text[],'A standing calf raise using a Smith machine to isolate and strengthen the calf muscles.',array['Bouncing for momentum','Partial range of motion','Allowing ankles to roll outward/inward']::text[],array['Move only at ankles','Keep legs straight (but not locked)','Control the movement','Pause at top']::text[],'Exhale as you rise, inhale as you lower.',4.5),
('0752','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Smith Machine Deadlift',array['erectors','erector spinae']::text[],array['gluteus maximus','hamstrings','trapezius','forearms']::text[],'smith machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/smith-deadlift-deadlift-1.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/smith-deadlift-deadlift-1.jpg',null,null,array['Position feet shoulder-width beneath the Smith bar.','Grip the bar just outside your knees with both hands.','Hinge hips back and lower torso, keeping chest up.','Extend hips and knees to lift the bar along the guides.','Lower the bar with control to the starting position.']::text[],'back','beginner',true,false,array['smith deadlift','smith bar deadlift','machine deadlift','Smith Deadlift - Deadlift (1)']::text[],'A guided barbell deadlift performed with a Smith machine to build lower back, glutes, and hamstrings strength.',array['Rounding the lower back','Lifting with arms instead of legs','Letting the bar drift away from body','Jerky movements']::text[],array['Hinge at hips','Keep back flat','Drive through heels','Bar close to shins']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the bar, exhale as you lift.',6.0),
('0748','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Smith Machine Leg Press',array['quadriceps','quadriceps femoris']::text[],array['gluteus maximus','hamstrings','adductors']::text[],'smith machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/smith-leg-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/smith-leg-press.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/smith-leg-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/smith-leg-press.jpg',array['Set the safety stops and load the appropriate weight.','Lie under the Smith bar and position feet wider than shoulder-width on the bar.','Unrack the bar by rotating your feet upward.','Lower the bar slowly toward your torso until legs form roughly a 90-degree angle.','Press the bar up by extending your knees and hips.']::text[],'upper legs','intermediate',true,false,array['smith machine leg press','smith lying leg press','smith platform press','Smith Leg Press','smith bench press']::text[],'A machine-based variation of leg press performed with a Smith machine barbell in a supine or incline position.',array['Incorrect foot placement','Pressing with toes only','Shallow movement','Letting knees cave inward']::text[],array['Keep core braced','Press evenly with both feet','Full range of motion','Maintain foot flatness']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the bar, exhale as you press upward.',6.0),
('0765','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Smith Seated Shoulder Press',array['delts','triceps']::text[],array['triceps','upper back']::text[],'smith machine','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/smith-seated-shoulder-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/smith-seated-shoulder-press.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/smith-seated-shoulder-press.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/smith-seated-shoulder-press.jpg',array['Set a bench or seat under the Smith bar so the bar starts around shoulder height when you sit down.','Sit tall with your back supported, plant your feet flat, and grip the bar just wider than shoulder width with palms forward.','Unrack the bar and hold it above your upper chest with wrists stacked over elbows.','Lower the bar in a straight path until it reaches about chin to shoulder level.','Press the bar straight up until your arms are extended overhead.','Lower the bar with control to the start position and repeat.','Finish by locking out the top and rotating the bar to re-rack it on the hooks.']::text[],'shoulders','beginner',true,false,array['smith seated shoulder press','seated smith machine shoulder press','smith machine overhead press','seated overhead press','machine shoulder press']::text[],'A seated overhead press on a Smith machine that trains the delts and triceps with a fixed bar path.',array['Lowering the bar behind the head','Flaring the elbows straight out to the sides','Arching the lower back off the bench','Letting the wrists bend back excessively']::text[],array['Keep ribs down','Press straight up','Wrists stacked over elbows','Feet flat and braced']::text[],'Inhale as you lower the bar to shoulder level, and exhale as you press it overhead.',6.0),
('0777','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Spell Caster',array['abs','obliques']::text[],array['obliques','lower back']::text[],'dumbbell','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/spell-caster.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/spell-caster.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/spell-caster.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/spell-caster.jpg',array['Stand tall with your feet about shoulder-width apart, holding one dumbbell with both hands in front of your hips.','Soften your knees and hinge slightly at your hips while keeping your chest up and back flat.','Rotate your torso and lower the dumbbell toward the outside of one foot.','Drive through your hips and return to the center with the dumbbell back in front of your hips.','Rotate to the other side and lower the dumbbell toward the outside of the opposite foot.','Continue alternating sides with controlled movement.']::text[],'waist','beginner',true,false,array['spell caster','dumbbell spell caster','alternating dumbbell toe touch','cross-body dumbbell reach','standing oblique twist with dumbbell']::text[],'A standing dumbbell core move where you hinge and rotate side to side, reaching the weight toward each foot to train the obliques.',array['Rounding the lower back as the dumbbell lowers','Bending mostly through the spine instead of hinging at the hips','Letting the knees cave inward during the reach','Swinging the dumbbell quickly instead of controlling each side']::text[],array['Rotate through your torso','Keep your back flat','Bend at the hips','Move with control']::text[],'Inhale as you lower and rotate toward one foot, then exhale as you return to center and switch sides.',6.0),
('1363','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Spine Stretch',array['spinal erectors','erector spinae']::text[],array['latissimus dorsi','hamstrings']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/stretching-spine-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/stretching-spine-stretch.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/stretching-spine-stretch.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/stretching-spine-stretch.jpg',array['Sit on floor with legs extended and feet flexed.','Extend arms straight ahead at shoulder height.','Inhale, then as you exhale, reach forward, articulating your spine.','Stretch forward as far as comfortable, keeping legs straight.','Hold and return slowly to start.']::text[],'back','beginner',false,false,array['spinal stretch','seated spine stretch','spine flexion stretch','Stretching - Spine Stretch','spine stretch']::text[],'A floor stretch focusing on lengthening the spine and improving flexibility in the lower back and hamstrings.',array['Rounding shoulders excessively','Forcing the stretch','Bending knees']::text[],array['Lengthen spine','Reach with fingertips','Keep legs straight','Relax neck']::text[],'Exhale as you stretch forward, inhale as you return to start.',3.8),
('drv-squat','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Squat',array['quadriceps','quadriceps femoris']::text[],array['gluteus maximus','hamstrings','erector spinae','adductors']::text[],'body weight','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/male/squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/male/squat.jpg','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/squat.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/squat.jpg',array['Stand with feet shoulder-width apart and toes slightly outward.','Brace core and keep chest up.','Initiate movement by pushing hips back and bending knees.','Descend until thighs are at least parallel to the floor.','Push through heels to return to standing.']::text[],'hips','beginner',true,false,array['bodyweight squat','air squat','barbell squat','back squat']::text[],'A foundational lower body movement that strengthens the quads, glutes, and hamstrings by bending and straightening the knees and hips.',array['Letting knees collapse inward','Rounding lower back','Not reaching parallel depth']::text[],array['Keep knees tracking toes','Maintain neutral spine','Weight on midfoot/heels','Chest up']::text[],'Inhale as you lower down, exhale as you stand up.',5.0),
('0353','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Stability Ball Leg Curl',array['hamstrings']::text[],array['glutes','calves','erector spinae']::text[],'stability ball',null,null,'https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/leg-curl-on-stability-ball.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/leg-curl-on-stability-ball.jpg',array['Lie face up on the floor, arms at your sides, heels on a stability ball.','Lift hips to form a straight line from shoulders to heels.','Bend knees to roll the ball toward your glutes.','Pause and squeeze your hamstrings.','Extend your legs to roll the ball back out.']::text[],'upper arms','intermediate',false,false,array['Swiss Ball Hamstring Curl','Physio Ball Leg Curl','Stability Ball Hamstring','Leg Curl (on stability ball)','dumbbell one arm concentration curl (on stability ball)']::text[],'A hamstring-focused curl using a stability ball for both resistance and core engagement.',array['Letting hips drop','Rapid reps','Not extending legs fully']::text[],array['Hips up','Control movement','Don’t let hips sag','Engage core']::text[],'Exhale as you curl in, inhale as you extend out.',4.5),
('0271','free-exercise-db-with-videos','Stability Ball Leg Elevated Crunch',array['rectus abdominis']::text[],array['obliques','hip flexors']::text[],'stability ball',null,null,'https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-videos/female/crunch-legs-on-stability-ball.mp4','https://pub-585d42eb1aa64a67aedf483ec328d3fe.r2.dev/exercise-posters/female/crunch-legs-on-stability-ball.jpg',array['Place stability ball in front of you and sit down.','Lie back and position your calves and feet on top of the ball with knees bent.','Place your hands lightly behind your head or crossed on your chest.','Engage your core and curl your upper body toward your knees.','Pause briefly at the top, then lower back down without losing control.']::text[],'waist','intermediate',false,false,array['crunch legs on stability ball','elevated crunch on ball','ball-supported crunch','stability ball crunch','Crunch (legs on stability ball)','crunch (on stability ball)']::text[],'A crunch variation where the legs rest on a stability ball, increasing core engagement and instability.',array['Using momentum instead of muscle','Straining the neck','Letting the ball roll away','Arching the lower back']::text[],array['Keep lower back pressed to floor','Do not pull with your neck','Control the movement','Exhale on lift']::text[],'Exhale as you crunch up, inhale as you lower down.',4.5),
